#: src/quick-start.md:10 src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:77
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: src/quick-start.md:12
msgid "[go](https://go.dev/dl/) version v1.23.0+"
msgstr "[go](https://go.dev/dl/) 版本 v1.23.0+"

#: src/quick-start.md:13
msgid "[docker](https://docs.docker.com/install/) version 17.03+."
msgstr "您已安装的 [docker](https://docs.docker.com/install/) 版本为 17.03 或更高。"

#: src/quick-start.md:14
msgid ""
"[kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/install-kubectl/) version "
"v1.11.3+."
msgstr "[kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/install-kubectl/) 版本 v1.11.3 及以上。"

#: src/quick-start.md:15
msgid "Access to a Kubernetes v1.11.3+ cluster."
msgstr "访问 Kubernetes v1.11.3+ 集群。"

#: src/quick-start.md:20
msgid ""
"Please, ensure that you see the [guidance](./"
"versions_compatibility_supportability.md)."
msgstr "请确保您查看[指导](./versions_compatibility_supportability.md)。"

#: src/quick-start.md:24 src/reference/kind.md:13 src/reference/envtest.md:6
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: src/quick-start.md:26
msgid "Install [kubebuilder](https://sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder):"
msgstr "安装 [kubebuilder](https://sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder)："

#: src/quick-start.md:29
msgid "# download kubebuilder and install locally.\n"
msgstr "# 下载 kubebuilder 并在本地安装。\n"

#: src/quick-start.md:30
msgid "\"https://go.kubebuilder.io/dl/latest/$(go env GOOS)/$(go env GOARCH)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/quick-start.md:37
msgid ""
"You can work with the master branch by cloning the repository and running "
"`make install` to generate the binary. Please follow the steps in the "
"section **How to Build Kubebuilder Locally** from the [Contributing Guide]"
"(https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING."
"md#how-to-build-kubebuilder-locally)."
msgstr "您可以通过克隆仓库并运行 `make install` 来生成二进制文件，从而使用主分支。请按照 [贡献指南](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#how-to-build-kubebuilder-locally) 中的 **如何在本地构建 Kubebuilder** 部分中的步骤进行操作。"

#: src/quick-start.md:45
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder provides autocompletion support via the command `kubebuilder "
"completion <bash|fish|powershell|zsh>`, which can save you a lot of typing. "
"For further information see the [completion](./reference/completion.md) "
"document."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了通过命令 `kubebuilder completion <bash|fish|powershell|zsh>` 的自动补全支持，这可以节省你很多输入时间。有关更多信息，请参阅 [completion](./reference/completion.md) 文档。"

#: src/quick-start.md:49
msgid "Create a Project"
msgstr "创建一个项目"

#: src/quick-start.md:51
msgid ""
"Create a directory, and then run the init command inside of it to initialize "
"a new project. Follows an example."
msgstr "创建一个目录，然后在其中运行初始化命令以初始化一个新项目。以下是一个示例。"

#: src/quick-start.md:62
msgid ""
"If your project is initialized within [`GOPATH`](https://go.dev/doc/code."
"html#GOPATH), the implicitly called `go mod init` will interpolate the "
"module path for you. Otherwise `--repo=<module path>` must be set."
msgstr "如果您的项目是在 [`GOPATH`](https://go.dev/doc/code.html#GOPATH) 中初始化的，则隐式调用的 `go mod init` 会为您插入模块路径。否则，必须设置 `--repo=<module path>`。"

#: src/quick-start.md:65
msgid ""
"Read the [Go modules blogpost](https://blog.go.dev/using-go-modules) if "
"unfamiliar with the module system."
msgstr "如果不熟悉模块系统，请阅读 [Go 模块博客文章](https://blog.go.dev/using-go-modules)。"

#: src/quick-start.md:69
msgid "Create an API"
msgstr "创建一个API"

#: src/quick-start.md:71
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a new API (group/version) as `webapp/v1` "
"and the new Kind(CRD) `Guestbook` on it:"
