"By following the [Operator Pattern](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/"
"extend-kubernetes/operator/), it’s possible not only to provide all expected "
"resources but also to manage them dynamically, programmatically, and at "
"execution time. To illustrate this idea, imagine if someone accidentally "
"changed a configuration or removed a resource by mistake; in this case, the "
"operator could fix it without any human intervention."
msgstr "通过遵循 [ Operator 模式](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)，不仅可以提供所有预期的资源，还可以动态地、以编程的方式和在执行时对其进行管理。为了说明这个想法，设想一下如果有人意外更改了配置或错误地移除了某个资源；在这种情况下，Operator 可以在没有任何人工干预的情况下进行修复。"

