"managing Memcached(s) instances on the cluster."
msgstr "接下来，我们将创建一个 API，负责在集群上部署和管理 Memcached 实例。"

#: src/getting-started.md:60
msgid "Understanding APIs"
msgstr "理解API"

#: src/getting-started.md:62
msgid ""
"This command's primary aim is to produce the Custom Resource (CR) and Custom "
"Resource Definition (CRD) for the Memcached Kind. It creates the API with "
"the group `cache.example.com` and version `v1alpha1`, uniquely identifying "
"the new CRD of the Memcached Kind. By leveraging the Kubebuilder tool, we "
"can define our APIs and objects representing our solutions for these "
"platforms."
msgstr "该命令的主要目标是为 Memcached 类型生成自定义资源（CR）和自定义资源定义（CRD）。它创建了一个 API，分组为 `cache.example.com`，版本为 `v1alpha1`，唯一标识 Memcached 类型的新 CRD。通过使用 Kubebuilder 工具，我们可以定义我们的 API 和对象，以表示我们针对这些平台的解决方案。"

#: src/getting-started.md:66
msgid ""
"While we've added only one Kind of resource in this example, we can have as "
"many `Groups` and `Kinds` as necessary. To make it easier to understand, "
"think of CRDs as the definition of our custom Objects, while CRs are "
"instances of them."
msgstr "虽然在这个例子中我们只添加了一种资源，但我们可以根据需要添加任意数量的 `Group` 和 `Kind`。为了更容易理解，可以将 CRD 看作是我们自定义对象的定义，而 CR 则是这些对象的实例。"

#: src/getting-started.md:72
msgid "[Groups and Versions and Kinds, oh my!](./cronjob-tutorial/gvks.md)."
msgstr "[组、版本和种类，真是让人头大！](./cronjob-tutorial/gvks.md)。"

