#: src/getting-started.md:90
msgid "Creating Status definitions"
msgstr "创建状态定义"

#: src/getting-started.md:92
msgid ""
"We also want to track the status of our Operations which will be done to "
"manage the Memcached CR(s). This allows us to verify the Custom Resource's "
"description of our own API and determine if everything occurred successfully "
"or if any errors were encountered, similar to how we do with any resource "
"from the Kubernetes API."
msgstr "我们还希望跟踪我们对Memcached自定义资源（CR）的管理操作的状态。这样可以让我们验证自定义资源对我们自有API的描述，并判断是否一切顺利进行，或者是否遇到任何错误，这与我们对Kubernetes API中的任何资源所做的操作类似。"

#: src/getting-started.md:98
msgid "// MemcachedStatus defines the observed state of Memcached\n"
msgstr "// MemcachedStatus 定义了 Memcached 的观察状态\n"

