msgid ""
"`json:\"conditions,omitempty\" patchStrategy:\"merge\" patchMergeKey:"
"\"type\" protobuf:\"bytes,1,rep,name=conditions\"`"
msgstr "`json:\"conditions,omitempty\" patchStrategy:\"merge\" patchMergeKey:\"type\" protobuf:\"bytes,1,rep,name=conditions\"`"

#: src/getting-started.md:107
msgid ""
"Kubernetes has established conventions, and because of this, we use Status "
"Conditions here. We want our custom APIs and controllers to behave like "
"Kubernetes resources and their controllers, following these standards to "
"ensure a consistent and intuitive experience."
msgstr "Kubernetes 已建立了一些约定，因此我们在这里使用状态条件。我们希望我们的自定义 API 和控制器表现得像 Kubernetes 资源及其控制器，遵循这些标准以确保一致和直观的体验。"

#: src/getting-started.md:112
msgid ""
"Please ensure that you review: [Kubernetes API Conventions](https://github."
"com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-"
"conventions.md#typical-status-properties)"
msgstr "请确保您查看以下内容：[Kubernetes API 约定](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#typical-status-properties)"

#: src/getting-started.md:116
msgid "Markers and validations"
msgstr "标记和验证"

#: src/getting-started.md:118
msgid ""
"Furthermore, we want to validate the values added in our CustomResource to "
"ensure that those are valid. To achieve this, we will use [markers](./"
"reference/markers.md), such as `+kubebuilder:validation:Minimum=1`."
msgstr "此外，我们希望验证我们在 CustomResource 中添加的值，以确保这些值是有效的。为此，我们将使用 [标记](./reference/markers.md)，例如 `+kubebuilder:validation:Minimum=1`。"

