msgstr "对账流程"

#: src/getting-started.md:281
msgid ""
"In a simplified way, Kubernetes works by allowing us to declare the desired "
"state of our system, and then its controllers continuously observe the "
"cluster and take actions to ensure that the actual state matches the desired "
"state. For our custom APIs and controllers, the process is similar. "
"Remember, we are extending Kubernetes' behaviors and its APIs to fit our "
"specific needs."
msgstr "以简化的方式来说，Kubernetes 通过允许我们声明系统的期望状态来工作，然后其控制器持续观察集群，并采取行动以确保实际状态与期望状态保持一致。对于我们的自定义 API 和控制器，过程类似。请记住，我们正在扩展 Kubernetes 的行为和 API，以满足我们的特定需求。"

#: src/getting-started.md:283
msgid "In our controller, we will implement a reconciliation process."
msgstr "在我们的控制器中，我们将实施一个对账流程。"

#: src/getting-started.md:285
msgid ""
"Essentially, the reconciliation process functions as a loop, continuously "
"checking conditions and performing necessary actions until the desired state "
"is achieved. This process will keep running until all conditions in the "
"system align with the desired state defined in our implementation."
msgstr "本质上， reconciliation 过程作为一个循环运行，不断检查条件并执行必要的操作，直到达到所需的状态。该过程将持续运行，直到系统中的所有条件与我们实施中定义的所需状态一致。"

#: src/getting-started.md:287
msgid "Here's a pseudo-code example to illustrate this:"
msgstr "这是一个伪代码示例来说明这一点："

#: src/getting-started.md:292
msgid ""
"// Check if a Deployment for the app exists, if not, create one\n"
"  // If there's an error, then restart from the beginning of the reconcile\n"
msgstr "// 检查应用的 Deployment 是否存在，如果不存在，则创建一个\n  // 如果发生错误，则从协调的开始重新启动\n"

#: src/getting-started.md:298
msgid ""
"// Check if a Service for the app exists, if not, create one\n"
"  // If there's an error, then restart from the beginning of the reconcile\n"
msgstr "// 检查应用程序是否存在服务，如果不存在，则创建一个\n  // 如果出现错误，则从协调的开头重新开始\n"

#: src/getting-started.md:304
msgid ""
"// Look for Database CR/CRD\n"
"  // Check the Database Deployment's replicas size\n"
"  // If deployment.replicas size doesn't match cr.size, then update it\n"
"  // Then, restart from the beginning of the reconcile. For example, by "
"returning `reconcile.Result{Requeue: true}, nil`.\n"
msgstr "// 查找数据库 CR/CRD\n  // 检查数据库部署的副本大小\n  // 如果 deployment.replicas 的大小与 cr.size 不匹配，则更新它\n  // 然后，从调和的开始重新启动。例如，通过返回 `reconcile.Result{Requeue: true}, nil`。"

#: src/getting-started.md:313
msgid ""
"// If at the end of the loop:\n"
"  // Everything was executed successfully, and the reconcile can stop\n"
msgstr "// 如果在循环结束时：\n  // 一切都成功执行，并且调和可以停止"

