"If you are deploying a webhook for pods in the same cluster, be careful "
"about the bootstrapping problem, since the creation request of the webhook "
"pod would be sent to the webhook pod itself, which hasn't come up yet."
msgstr "如果您在同一个集群中为 pod 部署 webhook，请注意引导问题，因为 webhook pod 的创建请求会发送到尚未启动的 webhook pod 本身。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:321
msgid ""
"To make it work, you can either use [namespaceSelector](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.14.5/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types."
"go#L189-L233) if your kubernetes version is 1.9+ or use [objectSelector]"
"(https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.15.2/"
"admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L262-L274) if your kubernetes version "
"is 1.15+ to skip itself."
msgstr "要使其正常工作，您可以使用 [namespaceSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.14.5/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L189-L233)，前提是您的 Kubernetes 版本为 1.9 及以上，或者如果您的 Kubernetes 版本为 1.15 及以上，则可以使用 [objectSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.15.2/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L262-L274) 来跳过自身。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:1
msgid "Writing controller tests"
msgstr "编写控制器测试"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:3
msgid ""
"Testing Kubernetes controllers is a big subject, and the boilerplate testing "
"files generated for you by kubebuilder are fairly minimal."
msgstr "测试 Kubernetes 控制器是一个大主题，而 kubebuilder 为您生成的样板测试文件相对较少。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:6
msgid ""
"To walk you through integration testing patterns for Kubebuilder-generated "
"controllers, we will revisit the CronJob we built in our first tutorial and "
"write a simple test for it."
msgstr "为了引导您了解用于 Kubebuilder 生成的控制器的集成测试模式，我们将重新审视在首个教程中构建的 CronJob，并为其编写一个简单的测试。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:8
msgid ""
"The basic approach is that, in your generated `suite_test.go` file, you will "
"use envtest to create a local Kubernetes API server, instantiate and run "
"your controllers, and then write additional `*_test.go` files to test it "
"using [Ginkgo](http://onsi.github.io/ginkgo)."
msgstr "基本的方法是，在您生成的 `suite_test.go` 文件中，您将使用 envtest 创建一个本地 Kubernetes API 服务器，实例化并运行您的控制器，然后编写额外的 `*_test.go` 文件，通过 [Ginkgo](http://onsi.github.io/ginkgo) 来进行测试。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:10
msgid ""
"If you want to tinker with how your envtest cluster is configured, see "
"section [Configuring envtest for integration tests](../reference/envtest.md) "
"as well as the [`envtest docs`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-"
"runtime/pkg/envtest?tab=doc)."
msgstr "如果您想要调整您的 envtest 集群的配置，请参阅[为集成测试配置 envtest](../reference/envtest.md)一节，以及[`envtest 文档`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/envtest?tab=doc)。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:12
msgid "Test Environment Setup"
msgstr "测试环境设置"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:14
msgid ""
"{{#literatego ../cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project/internal/controller/"
"suite_test.go}}"
msgstr "{{#literatego ../cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project/internal/controller/suite_test.go}}"

