#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:20
msgid ""
"This Status update example above demonstrates a general testing strategy for "
"a custom Kind with downstream objects. By this point, you hopefully have "
"learned the following methods for testing your controller behavior:"
msgstr "以上的状态更新示例展示了一种针对自定义 Kind 及其下游对象的一般测试策略。到目前为止，希望您已经学习了以下测试控制器行为的方法："

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:22
msgid "Setting up your controller to run on an envtest cluster"
msgstr "在 envtest 集群上设置您的控制器"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:23
msgid "Writing stubs for creating test objects"
msgstr "为创建测试对象编写存根"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:24
