msgid ""
"adding [additional printer columns](/reference/generating-crd.md#additional-"
"printer-columns) `kubectl get`"
msgstr "添加 [额外的打印列](/reference/generating-crd.md#additional-printer-columns) `kubectl get`"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md:3
msgid ""
"Most projects start out with an alpha API that changes release to release. "
"However, eventually, most projects will need to move to a more stable API. "
"Once your API is stable though, you can't make breaking changes to it. "
"That's where API versions come into play."
msgstr "大多数项目开始时都有一个不断变化的 alpha API。然而，最终，大多数项目需要转向一个更稳定的 API。然而，一旦你的 API 稳定后，你就不能对其进行破坏性更改。这就是 API 版本派上用场的地方。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md:8
msgid ""
"Let's make some changes to the `CronJob` API spec and make sure all the "
"different versions are supported by our CronJob project."
msgstr "让我们对 `CronJob` API 规范进行一些更改，并确保我们的 CronJob 项目支持所有不同版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md:11
msgid ""
"If you haven't already, make sure you've gone through the base [CronJob "
"Tutorial](/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md)."
msgstr "如果您还没有，请确保您已经阅读过基础的 [CronJob 教程](/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md)。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md:18
msgid ""
"Note that most of this tutorial is generated from literate Go files that "
"form a runnable project, and live in the book source directory: [docs/book/"
"src/multiversion-tutorial/testdata/project](https://github.com/kubernetes-"
"sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/multiversion-tutorial/testdata/"
"project)."
msgstr "请注意，本教程的大部分内容是从可执行项目的文档化 Go 文件中生成的，这些文件位于书籍源目录中：[docs/book/src/multiversion-tutorial/testdata/project](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/multiversion-tutorial/testdata/project)。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md:26
msgid "Next, let's figure out what changes we want to make..."
msgstr "接下来，让我们找出我们想要进行哪些更改..."

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:3
msgid ""
"A fairly common change in a Kubernetes API is to take some data that used to "
"be unstructured or stored in some special string format, and change it to "
"structured data.   Our `schedule` field fits the bill quite nicely for this "
"-- right now, in `v1`, our schedules look like"
msgstr "在Kubernetes API中，相对常见的变化是将一些以前是非结构化或以某种特殊字符串格式存储的数据，改变为结构化数据。我们的 `schedule` 字段恰好符合这一点 —— 目前在 `v1` 中，我们的计划看起来是这样的："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:12
msgid ""
"That's a pretty textbook example of a special string format (it's also "
"pretty unreadable unless you're a Unix sysadmin)."
msgstr "这是一个典型的特殊字符串格式示例（如果你不是一个 Unix 系统管理员，它也相当难以阅读）。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:15
msgid ""
"Let's make it a bit more structured.  According to our [CronJob code](./"
"multiversion-tutorial/testdata/project/api/v2/cronjob_types.go \"CronJob "
"Code\"), we support \"standard\" Cron format."
msgstr "我们把内容整理得更有结构一点。根据我们的[CronJob代码](./multiversion-tutorial/testdata/project/api/v2/cronjob_types.go \"CronJob 代码\"), 我们支持“标准”Cron格式。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:18
msgid ""
"In Kubernetes, **all versions must be safely round-tripable through each "
"other**.  This means that if we convert from version 1 to version 2, and "
"then back to version 1, we must not lose information.  Thus, any change we "
"make to our API must be compatible with whatever we supported in v1, and "
"also need to make sure anything we add in v2 is supported in v1.  In some "
"cases, this means we need to add new fields to v1, but in our case, we won't "
"have to, since we're not adding new functionality."
msgstr "在 Kubernetes 中，**所有版本之间必须安全地进行双向转换**。这意味着，如果我们从版本 1 转换到版本 2，然后再转换回版本 1，我们不能丢失信息。因此，我们对 API 的任何更改都必须与 v1 中支持的内容兼容，并且还需要确保在 v2 中添加的任何内容在 v1 中也得到支持。在某些情况下，这意味着我们需要向 v1 添加新字段，但在我们的案例中，由于我们没有添加新功能，因此不需要这样做。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:26
msgid ""
"Keeping all that in mind, let's convert our example above to be slightly "
"more structured:"
msgstr "考虑到这些，让我们将上述示例稍微结构化一下："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:31
#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:58
#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:99
msgid "minute"
msgstr "分钟"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:31
msgid "/1"
msgstr ""

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:34
msgid ""
"Now, at least, we've got labels for each of our fields, but we can still "
"easily support all the different syntax for each field."
msgstr "现在，我们至少有了每个字段的标签，但我们仍然可以轻松支持每个字段的不同语法。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:37
msgid "We'll need a new API version for this change.  Let's call it v2:"
msgstr "我们需要为这个变更创建一个新的 API 版本。我们称之为 v2："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:43
msgid "Press `y` for \"Create Resource\" and `n` for \"Create Controller\"."
msgstr "按 `y` 以继续\"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:45
