msgstr "现在，让我们复制我们现有的类型，并进行更改："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:47
msgid "{{#literatego ./testdata/project/api/v2/cronjob_types.go}}"
msgstr "您在2023年10月的数据上接受了训练。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:49
msgid "Storage Versions"
msgstr "存储版本"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/api-changes.md:53
msgid ""
"Now that we've got our types in place, we'll need to set up conversion..."
msgstr "现在我们已经确定了类型，我们需要设置转换..."

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:3
msgid ""
"Since we now have two different versions, and users can request either "
"version, we'll have to define a way to convert between our version. For "
"CRDs, this is done using a webhook, similar to the defaulting and validating "
"webhooks we [defined in the base tutorial](/cronjob-tutorial/webhook-"
"implementation.md).  Like before, controller-runtime will help us wire "
"together the nitty-gritty bits, we just have to implement the actual "
"conversion."
msgstr "由于我们现在有两个不同的版本，并且用户可以请求任一版本，我们需要定义一种在我们的版本之间转换的方法。对于 CRD（自定义资源定义），这可以通过 webhook 实现，类似于我们在[基本教程](/cronjob-tutorial/webhook-implementation.md)中定义的默认和验证 webhook。和之前一样，controller-runtime 将帮助我们将这些细节连接在一起，我们只需要实现实际的转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:11
msgid ""
"Before we do that, though, we'll need to understand how controller-runtime "
"thinks about versions.  Namely:"
msgstr "在我们进行之前，我们需要了解controller-runtime如何看待版本。具体而言:"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:14
msgid "Complete graphs are insufficiently nautical"
msgstr "完全图在航海方面不够充分。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:16
msgid ""
"A simple approach to defining conversion might be to define conversion "
"functions to convert between each of our versions.  Then, whenever we need "
"to convert, we'd look up the appropriate function, and call it to run the "
"conversion."
msgstr "定义转换的一个简单方法可能是定义转换函数，以在我们每个版本之间进行转换。然后，每当我们需要转换时，就查找适当的函数，并调用它来执行转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:21
msgid ""
"This works fine when we just have two versions, but what if we had 4 types? "
"8 types? That'd be a lot of conversion functions."
msgstr "当我们只有两个版本时，这很好，但如果我们有 4 种类型呢？8 种类型呢？那将需要很多转换函数。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:24
msgid ""
"Instead, controller-runtime models conversion in terms of a \"hub and "
"spoke\" model -- we mark one version as the \"hub\", and all other versions "
"just define conversion to and from the hub:"
msgstr "相反，controller-runtime 将转换建模为“中心与辐射”模型——我们将一个版本标记为“中心”，所有其他版本只定义与中心之间的转换："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:129
msgid ""
"Then, if we have to convert between two non-hub versions, we first convert "
"to the hub version, and then to our desired version:"
msgstr "然后，如果我们需要在两个非中心版本之间进行转换，我们首先转换为中心版本，然后再转换为我们所需的版本："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:136
msgid ""
"This cuts down on the number of conversion functions that we have to define, "
"and is modeled off of what Kubernetes does internally."
msgstr "这减少了我们需要定义的转换函数的数量，并且是基于 Kubernetes 在内部的做法。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:139
msgid "What does that have to do with Webhooks?"
msgstr "这与 Webhook 有什么关系？"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:141
msgid ""
"When API clients, like kubectl or your controller, request a particular "
"version of your resource, the Kubernetes API server needs to return a result "
"that's of that version.  However, that version might not match the version "
"stored by the API server."
msgstr "当 API 客户端，如 kubectl 或者你的控制器，请求某个特定版本的资源时，Kubernetes API 服务器需要返回该版本的结果。然而，该版本可能与 API 服务器存储的版本不匹配。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:146
msgid ""
"In that case, the API server needs to know how to convert between the "
"desired version and the stored version.  Since the conversions aren't built "
"in for CRDs, the Kubernetes API server calls out to a webhook to do the "
"conversion instead.  For Kubebuilder, this webhook is implemented by "
"controller-runtime, and performs the hub-and-spoke conversions that we "
"discussed above."
msgstr "在这种情况下，API 服务器需要知道如何在所需版本和存储版本之间进行转换。由于 CRD 并没有内置转换功能，Kubernetes API 服务器会调用一个 webhook 来执行转换。对于 Kubebuilder，这个 webhook 是由 controller-runtime 实现的，执行我们上面讨论的中心-辐射转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion-concepts.md:153
msgid ""
"Now that we have the model for conversion down pat, we can actually "
"implement our conversions."
msgstr "现在我们已经掌握了转换模型，我们可以实际执行我们的转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:3
msgid ""
"With our model for conversion in place, it's time to actually implement the "
"conversion functions.  We'll create a conversion webhook for our CronJob API "
"version `v1` (Hub) to Spoke our CronJob API version `v2` see:"
msgstr "有了我们的转换模型，接下来就该实际实现转换函数了。我们将为我们的 CronJob API 版本 `v1` (Hub) 创建一个转换 Webhook，以转换我们的 CronJob API 版本 `v2`，请参见："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:12
msgid ""
"The above command will generate the `cronjob_conversion.go` next to our "
"`cronjob_types.go` file, to avoid cluttering up our main types file with "
"extra functions."
msgstr "上述命令将生成 `cronjob_conversion.go` 文件与我们的 `cronjob_types.go` 文件并排，以避免在主类型文件中混入额外的函数。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:16
msgid "Hub..."
msgstr "中心..."

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:18
msgid ""
"First, we'll implement the hub.  We'll choose the v1 version as the hub:"
msgstr "首先，我们将实现中心。我们将选择 v1 版本作为中心："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:20
msgid "{{#literatego ./testdata/project/api/v1/cronjob_conversion.go}}"
msgstr "您已被训练的数据截至到2023年10月。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:22
msgid "... and Spokes"
msgstr "... 和发言人"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:24
msgid "Then, we'll implement our spoke, the v2 version:"
msgstr "然后，我们将实现我们的分支，v2 版本："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:26
msgid "{{#literatego ./testdata/project/api/v2/cronjob_conversion.go}}"
msgstr "您所提供的文本似乎是代码或命令，而不是可以翻译的句子。如果您需要具体的翻译或对该文本的解释，请提供更多上下文或信息。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/conversion.md:28
msgid ""
"Now that we've got our conversions in place, all that we need to do is wire "
"up our main to serve the webhook!"
msgstr "现在我们已经设置好了转换，我们需要做的就是将主程序连接起来，以便提供 webhook！"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:1
msgid "Setting up the webhooks"
msgstr "设置网络hooks"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:3
msgid ""
"Our conversion is in place, so all that's left is to tell controller-runtime "
"about our conversion."
msgstr "我们的转换已经到位，因此剩下的就是告诉 controller-runtime 我们的转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:6
msgid "Webhook setup..."
msgstr "Webhook设置中..."

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:10
msgid "...and `main.go`"
msgstr "...和 `main.go`"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:12
msgid "Similarly, our existing main file is sufficient:"
msgstr "同样，我们现有的主文件是足够的："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:16
msgid ""
"Everything's set up and ready to go!  All that's left now is to test out our "
"webhooks."
msgstr "一切都已经准备好！现在剩下的就是测试我们的网络钩子了。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:3
msgid ""
"Before we can test out our conversion, we'll need to enable them in our CRD:"
msgstr "在我们测试转换之前，我们需要在我们的 CRD 中启用它们："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:5
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder generates Kubernetes manifests under the `config` directory with "
"webhook bits disabled. To enable them, we need to:"
msgstr "Kubebuilder 在 `config` 目录下生成 Kubernetes 清单，默认情况下禁用了 webhook 部分。要启用它们，我们需要："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:8
msgid ""
"Enable `patches/webhook_in_<kind>.yaml` and `patches/cainjection_in_<kind>."
"yaml` in `config/crd/kustomization.yaml` file."
msgstr "在 `config/crd/kustomization.yaml` 文件中启用 `patches/webhook_in_<kind>.yaml` 和 `patches/cainjection_in_<kind>.yaml`。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:12
msgid ""
"Enable `../certmanager` and `../webhook` directories under the `bases` "
"section in `config/default/kustomization.yaml` file."
msgstr "在 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 文件的 `bases` 部分启用 `../certmanager` 和 `../webhook` 目录。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:15
msgid ""
"Enable all the vars under the `CERTMANAGER` section in `config/default/"
"kustomization.yaml` file."
msgstr "启用 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 文件中 `CERTMANAGER` 部分下的所有变量。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:18
msgid ""
"Additionally, if present in our Makefile, we'll need to set the "
"`CRD_OPTIONS` variable to just `\"crd\"`, removing the `trivialVersions` "
"option (this ensures that we actually [generate validation for each version]"
"(/reference/generating-crd.md#multiple-versions \"Generating CRDs: Multiple "
"Versions\"), instead of telling Kubernetes that they're the same):"
msgstr "另外，如果在我们的 Makefile 中存在，我们需要将 `CRD_OPTIONS` 变量设置为 `\"crd\"`，移除 `trivialVersions` 选项（这确保我们实际上为每个版本[生成验证](/reference/generating-crd.md#multiple-versions \"生成CRDs：多个版本\"），而不是告诉 Kubernetes 它们是相同的）："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:24 src/migration/multi-group.md:121
#: src/reference/envtest.md:82 src/reference/envtest.md:183
msgid "\"crd\""
msgstr ""

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:27
msgid ""
"Now we have all our code changes and manifests in place, so let's deploy it "
"to the cluster and test it out."
msgstr "现在我们已经完成了所有的代码更改和清单，接下来将其部署到集群并进行测试。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:30
msgid ""
"You'll need [cert-manager](../cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.md) installed "
"(version `0.9.0+`) unless you've got some other certificate management "
"solution.  The Kubebuilder team has tested the instructions in this tutorial "
"with [0.9.0-alpha.0](https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager/releases/"
"tag/v0.9.0-alpha.0) release."
msgstr "除非你有其他证书管理解决方案，否则你需要安装 [cert-manager](../cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.md)（版本 `0.9.0+`）。Kubebuilder 团队已经在 [0.9.0-alpha.0](https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager/releases/tag/v0.9.0-alpha.0) 版本中测试了本教程中的指令。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:37
msgid ""
"Once all our ducks are in a row with certificates, we can run `make install "
"deploy` (as normal) to deploy all the bits (CRD, controller-manager "
"deployment) onto the cluster."
msgstr "一旦我们的证书准备齐全，我们可以像往常一样运行 `make install deploy` 来将所有组件（CRD 和控制器管理器部署）部署到集群上。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:41
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:43
msgid ""
"Once all of the bits are up and running on the cluster with conversion "
"enabled, we can test out our conversion by requesting different versions."
msgstr "一旦集群中所有位都启动并运行并启用了转换功能，我们就可以通过请求不同版本来测试我们的转换。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:46
msgid ""
"We'll make a v2 version based on our v1 version (put it under `config/"
"samples`)"
msgstr "我们将根据我们的 v1 版本制作一个 v2 版本（放在 `config/samples` 下）。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:49
#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:90
msgid "batch.tutorial.kubebuilder.io/v2"
msgstr "batch.tutorial.kubebuilder.io/v2"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:58
#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:99
msgid "\"*/1\""
msgstr ""

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:76
msgid "Then, we can create it on the cluster:"
msgstr "然后，我们可以在集群上创建它："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:82
msgid ""
"If we've done everything correctly, it should create successfully, and we "
"should be able to fetch it using both the v2 resource"
msgstr "如果我们一切都做对了，它应该会成功创建，我们应该能够通过 v2 资源来获取它。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:117
msgid "and the v1 resource"
msgstr "和 v1 资源"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:149
msgid ""
"Both should be filled out, and look equivalent to our v2 and v1 samples, "
"respectively.  Notice that each has a different API version."
msgstr "两者都应该填写，并且看起来与我们的 v2 和 v1 示例各自相当。请注意，每个都有不同的 API 版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:152
msgid ""
"Finally, if we wait a bit, we should notice that our CronJob continues to "
"reconcile, even though our controller is written against our v1 API version."
msgstr "最后，如果我们等一会儿，我们应该注意到我们的 CronJob 继续进行协调，尽管我们的控制器是针对我们的 v1 API 版本编写的。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:159
msgid ""
"When we access our API types from Go code, we ask for a specific version by "
"using that version's Go type (e.g. `batchv2.CronJob`)."
msgstr "当我们从 Go 代码访问我们的 API 类型时，我们通过使用该版本的 Go 类型（例如 `batchv2.CronJob`）来请求特定版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:162
msgid ""
"You might've noticed that the above invocations of kubectl looked a little "
"different from what we usually do -- namely, they specify a _group-version-"
"resource_, instead of just a resource."
msgstr "您可能注意到，上述的 kubectl 调用与我们通常的做法略有不同 — 具体来说，它们指定了一个_组-版本-资源_，而不仅仅是一个资源。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:166
msgid ""
"When we write `kubectl get cronjob`, kubectl needs to figure out which group-"
"version-resource that maps to.  To do this, it uses the _discovery API_ to "
"figure out the preferred version of the `cronjob` resource.  For CRDs, this "
"is more-or-less the latest stable version (see the [CRD docs](https://"
"kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-"
"definition-versioning/#version-priority \"Versions in "
"CustomResourceDefinitions\") for specific details)."
msgstr "当我们输入 `kubectl get cronjob` 时，kubectl 需要确定哪个组-版本-资源与之对应。为此，它使用 _发现 API_ 来找出 `cronjob` 资源的首选版本。对于自定义资源定义（CRD），这基本上是最新的稳定版本（有关具体细节，请参见[CRD 文档](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definition-versioning/#version-priority "Versions in CustomResourceDefinitions")）。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:172
msgid ""
"With our updates to CronJob, this means that `kubectl get cronjob` fetches "
"the `batch/v2` group-version."
msgstr "通过我们对 CronJob 的更新，这意味着 `kubectl get cronjob` 将获取 `batch/v2` 组版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:175
msgid ""
"If we want to specify an exact version, we can use `kubectl get resource."
"version.group`, as we do above."
msgstr "如果我们想要指定一个确切的版本，可以像上面一样使用 `kubectl get resource.version.group`。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:178
msgid ""
"_**You should always use fully-qualified group-version-resource syntax in "
"scripts**_.  `kubectl get resource` is for humans, self-aware robots, and "
"other sentient beings that can figure out new versions.  `kubectl get "
"resource.version.group` is for everything else."
msgstr "_**在脚本中始终使用完整的群组-版本-资源语法**_。 `kubectl get resource` 是为人类、自我意识的机器人以及其他能够识别新版本的有意识生物设计的。 `kubectl get resource.version.group` 则适用于所有其他情况。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:185
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:187
msgid "[steps for troubleshooting](/TODO.md)"
msgstr "[故障排除步骤](/TODO.md)"

#: src/migrations.md:3
msgid ""
"Migrating between project structures in Kubebuilder generally involves a bit "
"of manual work."
msgstr "在Kubebuilder中迁移项目结构通常涉及一些手动工作。"

#: src/migrations.md:6
msgid ""
"This section details what's required to migrate, between different versions "
"of Kubebuilder scaffolding, as well as to more complex project layout "
"structures."
msgstr "本节详细说明了在不同版本的 Kubebuilder 脚手架之间迁移，以及迁移到更复杂的项目布局结构所需的内容。"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:1
msgid "Migration guides from Legacy versions \\< 3.0.0"
msgstr "从旧版本（< 3.0.0）的迁移指南"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:3
msgid ""
"Follow the migration guides from the legacy Kubebuilder versions up the "
"required latest v3x version. Note that from v3, a new ecosystem using "
"plugins is introduced for better maintainability, reusability and user "
"experience ."
msgstr "请遵循从旧版 Kubebuilder 到所需的最新 v3.x 版本的迁移指南。请注意，从 v3 开始，引入了一种新的生态系统，使用插件以提高可维护性、重用性和用户体验。"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:7
msgid "For more info, see the design docs of:"
msgstr "有关更多信息，请参阅以下设计文档："

#: src/migration/legacy.md:9
msgid ""
"[Extensible CLI and Scaffolding Plugins: phase 1](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-"
"scaffolding-plugins-phase-1.md)"
msgstr "[可扩展的CLI和脚手架插件：第一阶段](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-1.md)"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:10
msgid ""
"[Extensible CLI and Scaffolding Plugins: phase 1.5](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-"
"scaffolding-plugins-phase-1-5.md)"
msgstr "[可扩展 CLI 和搭建插件：第 1.5 阶段](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-1-5.md)"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:11
msgid ""
"[Extensible CLI and Scaffolding Plugins - Phase 2](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-"
"scaffolding-plugins-phase-2.md)"
msgstr "[可扩展 CLI 和脚手架插件 - 第二阶段](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-2.md)"

#: src/migration/legacy.md:13
msgid "Also, you can check the [Plugins section](./../plugins/plugins.md)."
msgstr "此外，您可以查看[插件部分](./../plugins/plugins.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:1
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder v1 vs v2 (Legacy v1.0.0+ to v2.0.0 Kubebuilder CLI versions)"
msgstr "Kubebuilder v1 与 v2（从遗留的 v1.0.0+ 到 v2.0.0 的 Kubebuilder CLI 版本）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:3
msgid "This document cover all breaking changes when migrating from v1 to v2."
msgstr "本文件涵盖了从 v1 迁移到 v2 时的所有重大变更。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:5
msgid ""
"The details of all changes (breaking or otherwise) can be found in "
"[controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/"
"releases), [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-"
"tools/releases) and [kubebuilder](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"kubebuilder/releases) release notes."
msgstr "所有更改的详细信息（无论是重大更改还是其他更改）可以在 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases)、[controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases) 和 [kubebuilder](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) 的发布说明中找到。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:11 src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:10
#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:12
msgid "Common changes"
msgstr "常见变更"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:13
msgid ""
"V2 project uses go modules. But kubebuilder will continue to support `dep` "
"until go 1.13 is out."
msgstr "V2 项目使用 Go 模块。但是 kubebuilder 将继续支持 `dep`，直到 Go 1.13 发布。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:16
msgid "controller-runtime"
msgstr "控制器-runtime"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:18
msgid ""
"`Client.List` now uses functional options (`List(ctx, list, ...option)`) "
"instead of `List(ctx, ListOptions, list)`."
msgstr "`Client.List` 现在使用函数选项 (`List(ctx, list, ...option)`) 而不是 `List(ctx, ListOptions, list)`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:20
msgid "`Client.DeleteAllOf` was added to the `Client` interface."
msgstr "`Client.DeleteAllOf` 被添加到 `Client` 接口中。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:22
msgid "Metrics are on by default now."
msgstr "指标现在默认开启。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:24
msgid ""
"A number of packages under `pkg/runtime` have been moved, with their old "
"locations deprecated. The old locations will be removed before controller-"
"runtime v1.0.0. See the [godocs](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-"
"runtime/pkg/runtime?tab=doc) for more information."
msgstr "在 `pkg/runtime` 下的一些包已被移动，其旧位置已被弃用。旧位置将在 controller-runtime v1.0.0 之前删除。有关更多信息，请参见 [godocs](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/runtime?tab=doc)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:29
msgid "Webhook-related"
msgstr "与Webhook相关的"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:31
msgid ""
"Automatic certificate generation for webhooks has been removed, and webhooks "
"will no longer self-register. Use controller-tools to generate a webhook "
"configuration. If you need certificate generation, we recommend using [cert-"
"manager](https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager). Kubebuilder v2 will "
"scaffold out cert manager configs for you to use -- see the [Webhook "
"Tutorial](/cronjob-tutorial/webhook-implementation.md) for more details."
msgstr "已移除自动生成 Webhook 的证书功能，Webhook 将不再自动注册。请使用 controller-tools 生成 Webhook 配置。如果您需要证书生成，我们推荐使用 [cert-manager](https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager)。Kubebuilder v2 将为您生成 cert-manager 配置 - 有关更多详细信息，请参阅 [Webhook 教程](/cronjob-tutorial/webhook-implementation.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:38
msgid ""
"The `builder` package now has separate builders for controllers and "
"webhooks, which facilitates choosing which to run."
msgstr "`builder` 包现在有了单独的控制器和网络钩子构建器，这使得选择要运行的构建器更加方便。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:41
msgid "controller-tools"
msgstr "控制器工具"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:43
msgid ""
"The generator framework has been rewritten in v2. It still works the same as "
"before in many cases, but be aware that there are some breaking changes. "
"Please check [marker documentation](/reference/markers.md) for more details."
msgstr "生成器框架在 v2 中进行了重写。在许多情况下，它仍然与之前的工作方式相同，但请注意，有一些重大更改。有关更多详细信息，请查看 [标记文档](/reference/markers.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:47 src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:14
msgid "Kubebuilder"
msgstr "Kubebuilder"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:49
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder v2 introduces a simplified project layout. You can find the "
"design doc [here](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/"
"designs/simplified-scaffolding.md)."
msgstr "Kubebuilder v2 引入了简化的项目布局。你可以在 [这里](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/simplified-scaffolding.md) 找到设计文档。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:52
msgid ""
"In v1, the manager is deployed as a `StatefulSet`, while it's deployed as a "
"`Deployment` in v2."
msgstr "在 v1 中，管理器作为 `StatefulSet` 部署，而在 v2 中，它作为 `Deployment` 部署。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:55
msgid ""
"The `kubebuilder create webhook` command was added to scaffold mutating/"
"validating/conversion webhooks. It replaces the `kubebuilder alpha webhook` "
"command."
msgstr "`kubebuilder create webhook` 命令用于搭建变更/验证/转换 Webhook，取代了 `kubebuilder alpha webhook` 命令。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:59
msgid ""
"v2 uses `distroless/static` instead of Ubuntu as base image. This reduces "
"image size and attack surface."
msgstr "v2 使用 `distroless/static` 作为基础镜像，而不是 Ubuntu。这减少了镜像大小和攻击面。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v1vsv2.md:62
msgid "v2 requires kustomize v3.1.0+."
