#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:1
msgid "Migration from v1 to v2"
msgstr "从 v1 迁移到 v2"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:3
msgid ""
"Make sure you understand the [differences between Kubebuilder v1 and v2](./"
"v1vsv2.md) before continuing"
msgstr "在继续之前，请务必了解 [Kubebuilder v1 和 v2 之间的差异](./v1vsv2.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:6
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:6
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:6
msgid ""
"Please ensure you have followed the [installation guide](/quick-start."
"md#installation) to install the required components."
msgstr "请确保您已按照[安装指南](/quick-start.md#installation)安装所需的组件。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:9
msgid ""
"The recommended way to migrate a v1 project is to create a new v2 project "
"and copy over the API and the reconciliation code. The conversion will end "
"up with a project that looks like a native v2 project. However, in some "
"cases, it's possible to do an in-place upgrade (i.e. reuse the v1 project "
"layout, upgrading controller-runtime and controller-tools."
msgstr "推荐的迁移 v1 项目的方法是创建一个新的 v2 项目，并复制 API 和协调代码。转换后将得到一个看起来像原生 v2 项目的项目。然而，在某些情况下，也可以进行就地升级（即重用 v1 项目布局，升级 controller-runtime 和 controller-tools）。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:15
msgid ""
"Let's take as example an V1 project and migrate it to Kubebuilder v2. At the "
"end, we should have something that looks like the [example v2 project]"
"(https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/"
"cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project)."
msgstr "我们以一个 V1 项目为例，将其迁移到 Kubebuilder v2。最后，我们应该得到的项目应该类似于 [示例 v2 项目](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project)。"

