#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:137
msgid "Webhooks for Core Types and External CRDs"
msgstr "核心类型和外部 CRD 的 Webhook"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:139
msgid ""
"If you are using webhooks for Kubernetes core types (e.g. Pods), or for an "
"external CRD that is not owned by you, you can refer the [controller-runtime "
"example for builtin types](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/examples/"
"builtins) and do something similar. Kubebuilder doesn't scaffold much for "
"these cases, but you can use the library in controller-runtime."
msgstr "如果您正在为 Kubernetes 核心类型（例如 Pods）或不属于您的外部 CRD 使用 webhook，您可以参考 [controller-runtime 的内置类型示例](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/examples/builtins) 并进行类似的操作。Kubebuilder 在这些情况下不会生成很多内容，但您可以使用 controller-runtime 中的库。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:145
msgid "Scaffold Webhooks for our CRDs"
msgstr "为我们的自定义资源定义（CRD）搭建 Webhooks。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:147
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:128
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:117
msgid ""
"Now let's scaffold the webhooks for our CRD (CronJob). We'll need to run the "
"following command with the `--defaulting` and `--programmatic-validation` "
"flags (since our test project uses defaulting and validating webhooks):"
msgstr "现在让我们为我们的 CRD（CronJob）搭建 Webhook。我们需要使用 `--defaulting` 和 `--programmatic-validation` 标志运行以下命令（因为我们的测试项目使用了默认值和验证 Webhook）："

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:155
msgid ""
"Depending on how many CRDs need webhooks, we may need to run the above "
"command multiple times with different Group-Version-Kinds."
msgstr "根据需要多少个 CRD（自定义资源定义）使用 Webhook，我们可能需要多次运行上述命令，并使用不同的组-版本-类型。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:158
msgid ""
"Now, we'll need to copy the logic for each webhook. For validating webhooks, "
"we can copy the contents from `func validatingCronJobFn` in `pkg/"
"default_server/cronjob/validating/cronjob_create_handler.go` to `func "
"ValidateCreate` in `api/v1/cronjob_webhook.go` and then the same for "
"`update`."
msgstr "现在，我们需要为每个 webhook 复制逻辑。对于验证 webhook，我们可以将 `pkg/default_server/cronjob/validating/cronjob_create_handler.go` 中的 `func validatingCronJobFn` 的内容复制到 `api/v1/cronjob_webhook.go` 中的 `func ValidateCreate`，然后更新操作也可以同样处理。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:163
msgid "Similarly, we'll copy from `func mutatingCronJobFn` to `func Default`."
msgstr "类似地，我们将从 `func mutatingCronJobFn` 复制到 `func Default`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:165
msgid "Webhook Markers"
msgstr "Webhook 标记"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:167
msgid "When scaffolding webhooks, Kubebuilder v2 adds the following markers:"
msgstr "在搭建 webhooks 时，Kubebuilder v2 添加了以下标记："

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:169
msgid ""
"```\n"
"// These are v2 markers\n"
"\n"
"// This is for the mutating webhook\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:path=/mutate-batch-tutorial-kubebuilder-io-v1-"
"cronjob,mutating=true,failurePolicy=fail,groups=batch.tutorial.kubebuilder."
"io,resources=cronjobs,verbs=create;update,versions=v1,name=mcronjob.kb.io\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"// This is for the validating webhook\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:path=/validate-batch-tutorial-kubebuilder-io-v1-"
"cronjob,mutating=false,failurePolicy=fail,groups=batch.tutorial.kubebuilder."
"io,resources=cronjobs,verbs=create;update,versions=v1,name=vcronjob.kb.io\n"
"```"
msgstr "```
// 这些是 v2 标记

// 这是用于变更的 Webhook
// +kubebuilder:webhook:path=/mutate-batch-tutorial-kubebuilder-io-v1-cronjob,mutating=true,failurePolicy=fail,groups=batch.tutorial.kubebuilder.io,resources=cronjobs,verbs=create;update,versions=v1,name=mcronjob.kb.io

...

// 这是用于验证的 Webhook
// +kubebuilder:webhook:path=/validate-batch-tutorial-kubebuilder-io-v1-cronjob,mutating=false,failurePolicy=fail,groups=batch.tutorial.kubebuilder.io,resources=cronjobs,verbs=create;update,versions=v1,name=vcronjob.kb.io
```"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:181
msgid ""
"The default verbs are `verbs=create;update`. We need to ensure `verbs` "
"matches what we need. For example, if we only want to validate creation, "
"then we would change it to `verbs=create`."
msgstr "默认的动词是 `verbs=create;update`。我们需要确保 `verbs` 与我们的需求相匹配。例如，如果我们只想验证创建，就需要将其更改为 `verbs=create`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:185
msgid "We also need to ensure `failure-policy` is still the same."
msgstr "我们还需要确保 `failure-policy` 仍然保持不变。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:187
msgid ""
"Markers like the following are no longer needed (since they deal with self-"
"deploying certificate configuration, which was removed in v2):"
msgstr "以下标记不再需要（因为它们涉及自我部署证书配置，而该配置在 v2 中已被移除）："

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:191
msgid ""
"// v1 markers\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:port=9876,cert-dir=/tmp/cert\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:service=test-system:webhook-service,selector=app:"
"webhook-server\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:secret=test-system:webhook-server-secret\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:mutating-webhook-config-name=test-mutating-webhook-"
"cfg\n"
"// +kubebuilder:webhook:validating-webhook-config-name=test-validating-"
"webhook-cfg\n"
msgstr "// v1 标记\n// +kubebuilder:webhook:port=9876,cert-dir=/tmp/cert\n// +kubebuilder:webhook:service=test-system:webhook-service,selector=app:webhook-server\n// +kubebuilder:webhook:secret=test-system:webhook-server-secret\n// +kubebuilder:webhook:mutating-webhook-config-name=test-mutating-webhook-cfg\n// +kubebuilder:webhook:validating-webhook-config-name=test-validating-webhook-cfg\n"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:199
msgid ""
"In v1, a single webhook marker may be split into multiple ones in the same "
"paragraph. In v2, each webhook must be represented by a single marker."
msgstr "在 v1 中，一个 webhook 标记可能在同一段落中拆分成多个标记。在 v2 中，每个 webhook 必须由一个单独的标记表示。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:202
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:138
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:127
msgid "Others"
msgstr "其他人"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:204
msgid ""
"If there are any manual updates in `main.go` in v1, we need to port the "
"changes to the new `main.go`. We'll also need to ensure all of the needed "
"schemes have been registered."
msgstr "如果在 v1 的 `main.go` 中有任何手动更新，我们需要将这些更改移植到新的 `main.go` 中。我们还需要确保所有所需的方案已经注册。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:208
msgid ""
"If there are additional manifests added under `config` directory, port them "
"as well."
msgstr "如果在 `config` 目录下添加了其他清单，也将它们移植过来。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:211
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:144
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:148
msgid "Change the image name in the Makefile if needed."
msgstr "如果需要，请在Makefile中更改图像名称。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v1tov2.md:213
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:146
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:311
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:658
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:150
#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:189
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

