msgstr "最后，我们可以运行 `make` 和 `make docker-build` 来确保一切正常。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:1
msgid "Kubebuilder v2 vs v3 (Legacy Kubebuilder v2.0.0+ layout to 3.0.0+)"
msgstr "Kubebuilder v2 与 v3 （旧版 Kubebuilder v2.0.0+ 布局到 3.0.0+）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:3
msgid "This document covers all breaking changes when migrating from v2 to v3."
msgstr "本文档涵盖了从 v2 迁移到 v3 时的所有重大更改。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:5
msgid ""
"The details of all changes (breaking or otherwise) can be found in "
"[controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/"
"releases), [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-"
"tools/releases) and [kb-releases](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"kubebuilder/releases) release notes."
msgstr "所有更改（无论是破坏性或其他类型）的详细信息可以在 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases)、[controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases) 和 [kb-releases](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) 的发布说明中找到。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:12
msgid ""
"v3 projects use Go modules and request Go 1.18+. Dep is no longer supported "
"for dependency management."
msgstr "v3 项目使用 Go 模块，并要求 Go 1.18 及以上版本。Dep 不再支持用于依赖管理。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:16
msgid ""
