"kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-"
"phase-1.md), the [Extensible CLI and Scaffolding Plugins: phase 1.5](https://"
"github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-"
"and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-1-5.md) and the [Extensible CLI and "
"Scaffolding Plugins - Phase 2](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-"
"phase-2.md) design docs. Also, you can check the [Plugins section](./../../"
"plugins/plugins.md)."
msgstr "增加了对插件的初步支持。有关更多信息，请参阅 [可扩展 CLI 和脚手架插件：第一阶段](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-1.md)、[可扩展 CLI 和脚手架插件：第一阶段 1.5](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-1-5.md) 和 [可扩展 CLI 和脚手架插件：第二阶段](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/extensible-cli-and-scaffolding-plugins-phase-2.md) 设计文档。此外，您还可以查看 [插件部分](./../../plugins/plugins.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:20
msgid ""
"The `PROJECT` file now has a new layout.  It stores more information about "
"what resources are in use, to better enable plugins to make useful decisions "
"when scaffolding."
msgstr "`PROJECT` 文件现在有了新的布局。它存储了更多关于正在使用的资源的信息，以更好地帮助插件在搭建时做出有用的决策。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:22
msgid ""
"Furthermore, the PROJECT file itself is now versioned: the `version` field "
"corresponds to the version of the PROJECT file itself, while the `layout` "
"field indicates the scaffolding & primary plugin version in use."
msgstr "此外，PROJECT 文件本身现在也进行了版本控制：`version` 字段对应于 PROJECT 文件自己的版本，而 `layout` 字段则指示当前使用的脚手架和主插件版本。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:24
msgid ""
"The version of the image `gcr.io/kubebuilder/kube-rbac-proxy`, which is an "
"optional component enabled by default to secure the request made against the "
"manager, was updated from `0.5.0` to `0.11.0` to address security concerns. "
"The details of all changes can be found in [kube-rbac-proxy](https://github."
"com/brancz/kube-rbac-proxy/releases)."
msgstr "镜像 `gcr.io/kubebuilder/kube-rbac-proxy` 的版本从 `0.5.0` 更新到 `0.11.0`，这是一个默认启用的可选组件，用于保护对管理器的请求，以解决安全问题。所有更改的详细信息可以在 [kube-rbac-proxy](https://github.com/brancz/kube-rbac-proxy/releases) 中找到。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:26
msgid "TL;DR of the New `go/v3` Plugin"
msgstr "新版本 `go/v3` 插件的简述。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:28
msgid ""
"_**More details on this can be found at [here](https://github.com/kubernetes-"
"sigs/kubebuilder/releases), but for the highlights, check below**_"
msgstr "_**您可以在[这里](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases)找到更多详细信息，但请查看下面的亮点**_"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:35
msgid "Scaffolded/Generated API version changes:"
msgstr "搭建/生成的 API 版本变更："

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:36
msgid ""
"Use `apiextensions/v1` for generated CRDs (`apiextensions/v1beta1` was "
"deprecated in Kubernetes `1.16`)"
msgstr "使用 `apiextensions/v1` 来生成 CRD（在 Kubernetes `1.16` 中，`apiextensions/v1beta1` 已被弃用）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:37
msgid ""
"Use `admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1` for generated webhooks "
"(`admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1beta1` was deprecated in Kubernetes `1.16`)"
msgstr "对生成的 Webhook 使用 `admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1`（`admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1beta1` 在 Kubernetes `1.16` 中已被弃用）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:38
msgid ""
"Use `cert-manager.io/v1` for the certificate manager when webhooks are used "
"(`cert-manager.io/v1alpha2` was deprecated in `Cert-Manager 0.14`. More "
"info: [CertManager v1.0 docs](https://cert-manager.io/docs/installation/"
"upgrading/))"
msgstr "当使用 Webhook 时，请使用 `cert-manager.io/v1` 作为证书管理器（`cert-manager.io/v1alpha2` 在 `Cert-Manager 0.14` 中已被弃用。更多信息请参见：[CertManager v1.0 文档](https://cert-manager.io/docs/installation/upgrading/)）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:40
msgid "Code changes:"
msgstr "代码更改："

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:41
msgid ""
"The manager flags `--metrics-addr` and `enable-leader-election` now are "
"named `--metrics-bind-address` and `--leader-elect` to be more aligned with "
"core Kubernetes Components. More info: [\\#1839](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/issues/1839)"
msgstr "管理器的标志 `--metrics-addr` 和 `enable-leader-election` 现在被命名为 `--metrics-bind-address` 和 `--leader-elect`，以更好地与核心 Kubernetes 组件保持一致。更多信息：[\\#1839](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/issues/1839)"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:42
msgid ""
"Liveness and Readiness probes are now added by default using [`healthz.Ping`]"
"(https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/healthz#CheckHandler)."
msgstr "活跃性和就绪性探针现在默认使用 [`healthz.Ping`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/healthz#CheckHandler) 添加。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:43
msgid ""
"A new option to create the projects using ComponentConfig is introduced. For "
"more info see its [enhancement proposal](https://github.com/kubernetes/"
"enhancements/tree/master/keps/sig-cluster-lifecycle/wgs) and the [Component "
"config tutorial](../../component-config-tutorial/tutorial.md)"
msgstr "引入了一个新的选项，可以使用 ComponentConfig 创建项目。有关更多信息，请参阅其 [增强提案](https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/tree/master/keps/sig-cluster-lifecycle/wgs) 和 [组件配置教程](../../component-config-tutorial/tutorial.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:44
msgid ""
"Manager manifests now use `SecurityContext` to address security concerns. "
"More info: [\\#1637](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/"
"issues/1637)"
msgstr "管理器清单现在使用 `SecurityContext` 来解决安全问题。更多信息请查看：[\\#1637](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/issues/1637)"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:45
msgid "Misc:"
msgstr "杂项："

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:46
msgid ""
"Support for [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-"
"tools/releases) `v0.9.0` (for `go/v2` it is `v0.3.0` and previously it was "
"`v0.2.5`)"
msgstr "对 [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases) `v0.9.0` 的支持（对于 `go/v2` 是 `v0.3.0`，之前是 `v0.2.5`）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:47
msgid ""
"Support for [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"controller-runtime/releases) `v0.12.1` (for `go/v2` it is `v0.6.4` and "
"previously it was `v0.5.0`)"
msgstr "对 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases) `v0.12.1` 的支持（对于 `go/v2` 版本是 `v0.6.4`，之前是 `v0.5.0`）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:48
msgid ""
"Support for [kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/"
"releases) `v3.8.7` (for `go/v2` it is `v3.5.4` and previously it was "
"`v3.1.0`)"
msgstr "对[kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/releases) `v3.8.7`的支持（对于`go/v2`，是`v3.5.4`，之前是`v3.1.0`）"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:49
msgid "Required Envtest binaries are automatically downloaded"
msgstr "所需的 Envtest 二进制文件会自动下载。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:50
msgid "The minimum Go version is now `1.18` (previously it was `1.13`)."
msgstr "最低 Go 版本现在是 `1.18`（之前是 `1.13`）。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:55
msgid ""
"After using the CLI to create your project, you are free to customise how "
"you see fit. Bear in mind, that it is not recommended to deviate from the "
"proposed layout unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr "在使用CLI创建项目后，您可以根据自己的需要进行自定义。请记住，除非您知道自己在做什么，否则不建议偏离建议的布局。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:57
msgid ""
"For example, you should refrain from moving the scaffolded files, doing so "
"will make it difficult in upgrading your project in the future. You may also "
"lose the ability to use some of the CLI features and helpers. For further "
"information on the project layout, see the doc [What's in a basic project?]"
"(../../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"
msgstr "例如，您应该避免移动搭建好的文件，这样会使您日后升级项目时遇到困难。您可能还会失去使用一些 CLI 功能和助手的能力。有关项目布局的更多信息，请参阅文档 [一个基本项目包含什么？](../../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:61
msgid "Migrating to Kubebuilder v3"
msgstr "迁移到 Kubebuilder v3"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:63
msgid ""
"So you want to upgrade your scaffolding to use the latest and greatest "
"features then, follow up the following guide which will cover the steps in "
"the most straightforward way to allow you to upgrade your project to get all "
"latest changes and improvements."
msgstr "所以你想要升级你的脚手架以使用最新的功能，那么请按照下面的指南进行操作，该指南将以最简单明了的方式介绍步骤，使你能够升级你的项目，以获得所有最新的变更和改进。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:68
msgid ""
"The current scaffold done by the CLI (`go/v3`) uses [kubernetes-sigs/"
"kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/releases) v3 which "
"does not provide a valid binary for Apple Silicon (`darwin/arm64`). "
"Therefore, you can use the `go/v4` plugin instead which provides support for "
"this platform:"
msgstr "当前由 CLI (`go/v3`) 完成的脚手架使用 [kubernetes-sigs/kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/releases) v3，该版本未为 Apple Silicon (`darwin/arm64`) 提供有效的二进制文件。因此，您可以改用 `go/v4` 插件，该插件支持该平台："

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:78
msgid "[Migration Guide v2 to V3](migration_guide_v2tov3.md) **(Recommended)**"
msgstr "[迁移指南 v2 到 v3](migration_guide_v2tov3.md) **(推荐)**"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:80 src/migration/v3vsv4.md:54
msgid "By updating the files manually"
msgstr "通过手动更新文件"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:82
msgid ""
"So you want to use the latest version of Kubebuilder CLI without changing "
"your scaffolding then, check the following guide which will describe the "
"manually steps required for you to upgrade only your PROJECT version and "
"starts to use the plugins versions."
msgstr "因此，如果您想在不更改脚手架的情况下使用最新版本的 Kubebuilder CLI，请查看以下指南，该指南将描述您手动升级仅项目版本并开始使用插件版本所需的步骤。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:84
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:11
#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:58
#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:11
msgid ""
"This way is more complex, susceptible to errors, and success cannot be "
"assured. Also, by following these steps you will not get the improvements "
"and bug fixes in the default generated project files."
msgstr "这种方式更复杂，容易出错，成功也无法得到保证。此外，按照这些步骤操作，您将无法获得默认生成项目文件中的改进和bug修复。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:86
msgid ""
"You will check that you can still using the previous layout by using the `go/"
"v2` plugin which will not upgrade the [controller-runtime](https://github."
"com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases) and [controller-tools]"
"(https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases) to the latest "
"version used with `go/v3` becuase of its breaking changes. By checking this "
"guide you know also how to manually change the files to use the `go/v3` "
"plugin and its dependencies versions."
msgstr "您可以通过使用 `go/v2` 插件检查是否仍然可以使用之前的布局，该插件不会将 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases) 和 [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases) 升级到与 `go/v3` 一起使用的最新版本，因为这会导致不兼容的变化。通过查看此指南，您也可以了解如何手动更改文件以使用 `go/v3` 插件及其依赖版本。"

#: src/migration/legacy/v2vsv3.md:88
msgid ""
"[Migrating to Kubebuilder v3 by updating the files manually]"
"(manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md)"
msgstr "[通过手动更新文件迁移到 Kubebuilder v3](manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md)"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:1
msgid "Migration from v2 to v3"
msgstr "从 v2 迁移到 v3"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:3
msgid ""
"Make sure you understand the [differences between Kubebuilder v2 and v3]"
"(v2vsv3.md) before continuing."
msgstr "在继续之前，请确保您了解 [Kubebuilder v2 和 v3 之间的差异](v2vsv3.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:9
msgid ""
"The recommended way to migrate a v2 project is to create a new v3 project "
"and copy over the API and the reconciliation code. The conversion will end "
"up with a project that looks like a native v3 project. However, in some "
"cases, it's possible to do an in-place upgrade (i.e. reuse the v2 project "
"layout, upgrading [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"controller-runtime/releases) and [controller-tools](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases))."
msgstr "迁移 v2 项目的推荐方式是创建一个新的 v3 项目，并将 API 和协调代码复制过去。转换后的项目将类似于原生 v3 项目。然而，在某些情况下，可以进行就地升级（即重用 v2 项目的布局，升级 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases) 和 [controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools/releases)）。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:15
msgid "Initialize a v3 Project"
msgstr "初始化一个 v3 项目"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:20
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:31
msgid ""
"For the rest of this document, we are going to use `migration-project` as "
"the project name and `tutorial.kubebuilder.io` as the domain. Please, select "
"and use appropriate values for your case."
msgstr "在本文档的其余部分，我们将使用 `migration-project` 作为项目名称，并将 `tutorial.kubebuilder.io` 作为域名。请根据您的情况选择并使用适当的值。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:24
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:35
msgid ""
"Create a new directory with the name of your project. Note that this name is "
"used in the scaffolds to create the name of your manager Pod and of the "
"Namespace where the Manager is deployed by default."
msgstr "创建一个新目录，使用你的项目名称。请注意，这个名称在脚手架中用于创建你的管理器 Pod 的名称以及管理器默认部署的命名空间。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:32
msgid ""
"Now, we need to initialize a v3 project.  Before we do that, though, we'll "
"need to initialize a new go module if we're not on the `GOPATH`. While "
"technically this is not needed inside `GOPATH`, it is still recommended."
msgstr "现在，我们需要初始化一个 v3 项目。不过，在此之前，如果我们不在 `GOPATH` 目录下，就需要初始化一个新的 Go 模块。虽然在 `GOPATH` 内部技术上并不需要这样做，但仍然推荐这样做。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:49
msgid "Then, we can finish initializing the project with kubebuilder."
msgstr "然后，我们可以使用 kubebuilder 完成项目的初始化。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:67
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:78
msgid "Next, we'll re-scaffold out the API types and controllers."
msgstr "接下来，我们将重新搭建 API 类型和控制器。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:72
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:83
msgid ""
"For this example, we are going to consider that we need to scaffold both the "
"API types and the controllers, but remember that this depends on how you "
"scaffolded them in your original project."
msgstr "在这个例子中，我们将考虑需要搭建 API 类型和控制器，但请记住，这取决于您在原始项目中是如何搭建它们的。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:85
msgid ""
"Please run `kubebuilder edit --multigroup=true` to enable multi-group "
"support before migrating the APIs and controllers. Please see [this](/"
"migration/multi-group.md) for more details."
msgstr "请运行 `kubebuilder edit --multigroup=true` 以启用多组支持，然后再迁移 API 和控制器。有关更多详细信息，请参见 [此处](/migration/multi-group.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:89
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:100
msgid ""
"Now, let's copy the API definition from `api/v1/<kind>_types.go` in our old "
"project to the new one."
msgstr "现在，让我们将旧项目中的 `api/v1/<kind>_types.go` 文件中的 API 定义复制到新项目中。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:91
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:102
msgid ""
"These files have not been modified by the new plugin, so you should be able "
"to replace your freshly scaffolded files by your old one. There may be some "
"cosmetic changes. So you can choose to only copy the types themselves."
msgstr "这些文件没有被新的插件修改，所以您应该可以用旧的文件替换新生成的文件。可能会有一些外观上的变化。因此，您可以选择仅复制类型本身。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:95
msgid ""
"Now, let's migrate the controller code from `controllers/cronjob_controller."
"go` in our old project to the new one. There is a breaking change and there "
"may be some cosmetic changes."
msgstr "现在，让我们将旧项目中的 `controllers/cronjob_controller.go` 控制器代码迁移到新项目中。这里有一个重大更改，并且可能会有一些外观上的变化。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:97
msgid ""
"The new `Reconcile` method receives the context as an argument now, instead "
"of having to create it with `context.Background()`. You can copy the rest of "
"the code in your old controller to the scaffolded methods replacing:"
msgstr "新的 `Reconcile` 方法现在将上下文作为参数接收，而不再需要使用 `context.Background()` 来创建它。您可以将旧控制器中的其余代码复制到生成的方法中，替换："

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:102
#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:109
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:515
