msgstr "请查看 [sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime 从 0.8.0 及以上版本的发布文档](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/releases) 以了解重大变化。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:124
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:113
msgid "If you don't have any webhooks, you can skip this section."
msgstr "如果您没有任何 Webhook，可以跳过本节内容。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:136
#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:125
msgid ""
"Now, let's copy the webhook definition from `api/v1/<kind>_webhook.go` from "
"our old project to the new one."
msgstr "现在，让我们将旧项目中的 `api/v1/<kind>_webhook.go` 的 webhook 定义复制到新项目中。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:140
msgid ""
"If there are any manual updates in `main.go` in v2, we need to port the "
"changes to the new `main.go`. We’ll also need to ensure all of the needed "
"schemes have been registered."
msgstr "如果在v2中的`main.go`有任何手动更新，我们需要将这些更改移植到新的`main.go`中。同时，我们还需要确保所有需要的方案已被注册。"

#: src/migration/legacy/migration_guide_v2tov3.md:142
msgid ""
"If there are additional manifests added under config directory, port them as "
"well."
msgstr "如果在配置目录下添加了其他清单，请一并移植。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:1
msgid "Migration from v2 to v3 by updating the files manually"
msgstr "通过手动更新文件进行从 v2 到 v3 的迁移"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:3
msgid ""
"Make sure you understand the [differences between Kubebuilder v2 and v3]"
"(v2vsv3.md) before continuing"
msgstr "在继续之前，请确保您了解 [Kubebuilder v2 和 v3 之间的区别](v2vsv3.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:9
msgid ""
"The following guide describes the manual steps required to upgrade your "
"config version and start using the plugin-enabled version."
msgstr "以下指南描述了升级您的配置版本并开始使用插件支持版本所需的手动步骤。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:13
msgid ""
"Usually you will only try to do it manually if you customized your project "
"and deviated too much from the proposed scaffold. Before continuing, ensure "
"that you understand the note about [project customizations](v2vsv3."
"md#project-customizations). Note that you might need to spend more effort to "
"do this process manually than organize your project customizations to follow "
"up the proposed layout and keep your project maintainable and upgradable "
"with less effort in the future."
msgstr "通常情况下，如果您对项目进行了自定义并且偏离了建议的框架，您才会选择手动处理。在继续之前，请确保您理解关于[项目自定义](v2vsv3.md#project-customizations)的说明。请注意，手动执行此过程可能需要比组织项目自定义以遵循建议布局投入更多的精力，而后者可以让您的项目在未来更易于维护和升级。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:15
msgid ""
"The recommended upgrade approach is to follow the [Migration Guide v2 to V3]"
"(migration_guide_v2tov3.md) instead."
msgstr "推荐的升级方法是遵循 [从 V2 到 V3 的迁移指南](migration_guide_v2tov3.md)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:17
msgid "Migration from project config version \"2\" to \"3\""
msgstr "从项目配置版本迁移 \"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:19
msgid ""
"Migrating between project configuration versions involves additions, "
"removals, and/or changes to fields in your project's `PROJECT` file, which "
"is created by running the `init` command."
msgstr "在项目配置版本之间迁移涉及对您项目的 `PROJECT` 文件中的字段进行添加、删除和/或更改，该文件是通过运行 `init` 命令创建的。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:22
msgid ""
"The `PROJECT` file now has a new layout. It stores more information about "
"what resources are in use, to better enable plugins to make useful decisions "
"when scaffolding."
msgstr "`PROJECT` 文件现在有了新的布局。它存储了更多关于正在使用的资源的信息，以更好地帮助插件在搭建时做出有用的决策。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:24
msgid ""
"Furthermore, the `PROJECT` file itself is now versioned. The `version` field "
"corresponds to the version of the `PROJECT` file itself, while the `layout` "
"field indicates the scaffolding and the primary plugin version in use."
msgstr "此外，`PROJECT` 文件本身现在是版本化的。`version` 字段对应于 `PROJECT` 文件本身的版本，而 `layout` 字段则指示正在使用的框架和主要插件的版本。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:26
#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:336
