"Kubebuilder only supports core types and the APIs scaffolded in the project "
"by default unless you manually change the files you will be unable to work "
"with external-types."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 默认只支持核心类型和在项目中搭建的 API，除非您手动更改文件，否则将无法使用外部类型。"

