"Change your project to remove the Kubernetes deprecated API versions usage"
msgstr "将您的项目更改为删除对Kubernetes已弃用API版本的使用。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:668
msgid ""
"Make sure you understand [Versions in CustomResourceDefinitions](https://"
"kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-"
"definition-versioning/)."
msgstr "确保您了解 [自定义资源定义中的版本](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definition-versioning/)。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:673
msgid ""
"The following steps describe a workflow to upgrade your project to remove "
"the deprecated Kubernetes APIs: `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1beta1`, "
"`admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1beta1`, `cert-manager.io/v1alpha2`."
msgstr "以下步骤描述了一个工作流程，用于升级您的项目以移除已弃用的 Kubernetes API：`apiextensions.k8s.io/v1beta1`、`admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1beta1`、`cert-manager.io/v1alpha2`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:675
msgid ""
"The Kubebuilder CLI tool does not support scaffolded resources for both "
"Kubernetes API versions such as; an API/CRD with `apiextensions.k8s.io/"
"v1beta1` and another one with `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1`."
msgstr "Kubebuilder CLI 工具不支持同时使用具有两个 Kubernetes API 版本的脚手架资源，例如：一个 API/CRD 使用 `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1beta1`，另一个使用 `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:680
msgid ""
"If you scaffold a webhook using the Kubernetes API `admissionregistration."
"k8s.io/v1` then, by default, it will use the API `cert-manager.io/v1` in the "
"manifests."
msgstr "如果您使用 Kubernetes API `admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1` 创建一个 webhook，则默认情况下，它将使用清单中的 API `cert-manager.io/v1`。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:684
msgid ""
"The first step is to update your `PROJECT` file by replacing the `api."
"crdVersion:v1beta` and `webhooks.WebhookVersion:v1beta` with `api.crdVersion:"
"v1` and `webhooks.WebhookVersion:v1` which would look like:"
msgstr "第一步是更新您的 `PROJECT` 文件，将 `api.crdVersion:v1beta` 和 `webhooks.WebhookVersion:v1beta` 替换为 `api.crdVersion:v1` 和 `webhooks.WebhookVersion:v1`，如下所示："

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:704
msgid ""
"You can try to re-create the APIS(CRDs) and Webhooks manifests by using the "
"`--force` flag."
msgstr "您可以尝试使用 `--force` 标志重新创建 APIS（CRD）和 Webhooks 清单。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:709
msgid ""
"Note, however, that the tool will re-scaffold the files which means that you "
"will lose their content."
msgstr "请注意，该工具将重新构建文件，这意味着您将丢失其中的内容。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:711
msgid ""
"Before executing the commands ensure that you have the files content stored "
"in another place. An easy option is to use `git` to compare your local "
"change with the previous version to recover the contents."
msgstr "在执行命令之前，请确保将文件内容存储在其他地方。一个简单的选项是使用 `git` 来比较您本地的更改与以前版本，以恢复内容。"

#: src/migration/legacy/manually_migration_guide_v2_v3.md:715
msgid ""
"Now, re-create the APIS(CRDs) and Webhooks manifests by running the  "
"`kubebuilder create api` and `kubebuilder create webhook` for the same "
"group, kind and versions with the flag `--force`, respectively."
msgstr "现在，通过运行 `kubebuilder create api` 和 `kubebuilder create webhook` 命令，并分别使用 `--force` 标志，为相同的组、种类和版本重新创建 APIS（CRDs）和 Webhooks 清单。"

#: src/migration/v3-plugins.md:1
msgid "V3 - Plugins Layout Migration Guides"
msgstr "V3 - 插件布局迁移指南"

#: src/migration/v3-plugins.md:3
msgid ""
"Following the migration guides from the plugins versions. Note that the "
"plugins ecosystem was introduced with Kubebuilder v3.0.0 release where the "
"go/v3 version is the default layout since `28 Apr 2021`."
msgstr "请参阅插件版本的迁移指南。请注意，插件生态系统是在 Kubebuilder v3.0.0 版本中引入的，自 `2021年4月28日` 起，go/v3 版本是默认布局。"

#: src/migration/v3-plugins.md:7
msgid ""
"Therefore, you can check here how to migrate the projects built from "
"Kubebuilder 3.x with the plugin go/v3 to the latest."
msgstr "因此，您可以在这里查看如何将使用 Kubebuilder 3.x 和 go/v3 插件构建的项目迁移到最新版本。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:3
msgid ""
"This document covers all breaking changes when migrating from projects built "
"using the plugin go/v3 (default for any scaffold done since `28 Apr 2021`) "
"to the next version of the Golang plugin `go/v4`."
msgstr "本文档涵盖了从使用插件 go/v3（自 2021 年 4 月 28 日以来任何脚手架的默认选项）构建的项目迁移到下一个版本的 Golang 插件 go/v4 时的所有重大变更。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:5
msgid "The details of all changes (breaking or otherwise) can be found in:"
msgstr "所有更改（无论是重大更改还是其他更改）的详细信息可以在以下位置找到："

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:7
msgid ""
"[controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime)"
msgstr "[controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime)"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:8
msgid "[controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools)"
msgstr "[controller-tools](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools)"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:9
msgid ""
"[kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/releases/tag/"
"kustomize%2Fv5.0.0)"
msgstr "[kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/releases/tag/kustomize%2Fv5.0.0)"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:10
msgid ""
"[kb-releases](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) "
"release notes."
msgstr "[kb-releases](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) 发布说明。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:14
msgid "`go/v4` projects use Kustomize v5x (instead of v3x)"
msgstr "`go/v4` 项目使用 Kustomize v5x（而不是 v3x）"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:15
msgid ""
"note that some manifests under `config/` directory have been changed in "
"order to no longer use the deprecated Kustomize features such as env vars."
msgstr "请注意，`config/` 目录下的一些清单已被更改，以不再使用已弃用的 Kustomize 功能，例如环境变量。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:17
msgid ""
"A `kustomization.yaml` is scaffolded under `config/samples`. This helps "
"simply and flexibly generate sample manifests: `kustomize build config/"
"samples`."
msgstr "一个 `kustomization.yaml` 文件被创建在 `config/samples` 目录下。这有助于简单灵活地生成示例清单：`kustomize build config/samples`。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:18
msgid "adds support for Apple Silicon M1 (darwin/arm64)"
msgstr "添加对 Apple Silicon M1 (darwin/arm64) 的支持。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:19
msgid ""
"remove support to CRD/WebHooks Kubernetes API v1beta1 version which are no "
"longer supported since k8s 1.22"
msgstr "移除对不再支持的 CRD/WebHooks Kubernetes API v1beta1 版本的支持，该版本自 k8s 1.22 起不再得到支持。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:20
msgid ""
"no longer scaffold webhook test files with `\"k8s.io/api/admission/"
"v1beta1\"` the k8s API which is no longer served since k8s `1.25`. By "
"default webhooks test files are scaffolding using `\"k8s.io/api/admission/"
"v1\"` which is support from k8s `1.20`"
msgstr "不再使用 `\"k8s.io/api/admission/v1beta1\"` 来搭建 webhook 测试文件，因为从 k8s `1.25` 开始，该 API 已不再提供。默认情况下，webhook 测试文件使用 `\"k8s.io/api/admission/v1\"` 进行搭建，该 API 从 k8s `1.20` 起获得支持。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:22
msgid ""
"no longer provide backwards compatible support with k8s versions \\< `1.16`"
msgstr "不再为 k8s 版本低于 `1.16` 提供向后兼容的支持。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:23
msgid ""
"change the layout to accommodate the community request to follow the "
"[Standard Go Project Layout](https://github.com/golang-standards/project-"
"layout) by moving the api(s) under a new directory called `api`, "
"controller(s) under a new directory called `internal` and the `main.go` "
"under a new directory named `cmd`"
msgstr "将布局更改为以适应社区请求，遵循 [标准 Go 项目布局](https://github.com/golang-standards/project-layout)，将 API 移动到一个名为 `api` 的新目录，控制器移到一个名为 `internal` 的新目录，`main.go` 移动到一个名为 `cmd` 的新目录。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:29
msgid ""
"Further details can be found in the [go/v4 plugin section](./../plugins/go-"
"v4-plugin.md)"
msgstr "更多细节可以在 [go/v4 插件部分](./../plugins/go-v4-plugin.md) 找到。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:33
msgid "TL;DR of the New `go/v4` Plugin"
msgstr "新版本的 `go/v4` 插件简要说明："

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:35
msgid ""
"**_More details on this can be found at [here](https://github.com/kubernetes-"
"sigs/kubebuilder/releases), but for the highlights, check below_**"
msgstr "**_有关此内容的更多详细信息，请查看 [这里](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases)，但如果想了解要点，请查看以下内容_**"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:42
msgid ""
"For example, you should refrain from moving the scaffolded files, doing so "
"will make it difficult in upgrading your project in the future. You may also "
"lose the ability to use some of the CLI features and helpers. For further "
"information on the project layout, see the doc [What's in a basic project?]"
"(./../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"
msgstr "例如，您应该避免移动架构文件，这样做会使将来升级项目变得困难。您可能还会失去使用某些 CLI 功能和助手的能力。有关项目结构的更多信息，请参阅文档 [基本项目包含哪些内容？](./../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:46
msgid "Migrating to Kubebuilder go/v4"
msgstr "迁移到 Kubebuilder go/v4"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:48
msgid ""
"If you want to upgrade your scaffolding to use the latest and greatest "
"features then, follow the guide which will cover the steps in the most "
"straightforward way to allow you to upgrade your project to get all latest "
"changes and improvements."
msgstr "如果您想升级您的脚手架以使用最新和最优秀的功能，请按照本指南进行操作，该指南将以最简单明了的方式介绍步骤，以便您能够升级您的项目，获取所有最新的变更和改进。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:52
msgid ""
"[Migration Guide go/v3 to go/v4](migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md) "
"**(Recommended)**"
msgstr "[迁移指南 go/v3 到 go/v4](migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md) **（推荐）**"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:56
msgid ""
"If you want to use the latest version of Kubebuilder CLI without changing "
"your scaffolding then, check the following guide which will describe the "
"steps to be performed manually to upgrade only your PROJECT version and "
"start using the plugins versions."
msgstr "如果您想在不更改脚手架的情况下使用最新版本的 Kubebuilder CLI，请查看以下指南，该指南将描述手动执行的步骤，以便仅升级您的项目版本并开始使用插件版本。"

#: src/migration/v3vsv4.md:60
msgid ""
"[Migrating to go/v4 by updating the files manually]"
"(manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md)"
msgstr "[通过手动更新文件迁移到 go/v4](manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md)"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:1
msgid "Migration from go/v3 to go/v4"
msgstr "从 go/v3 迁移到 go/v4"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:3
#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:3
msgid ""
"Make sure you understand the [differences between Kubebuilder go/v3 and go/"
"v4](v3vsv4.md) before continuing."
msgstr "在继续之前，请确保您了解 [Kubebuilder go/v3 和 go/v4 之间的区别](v3vsv4.md)。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:6
#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:6
msgid ""
"Please ensure you have followed the [installation guide](./../quick-start."
"md#installation) to install the required components."
msgstr "请确保您已经按照[安装指南](./../quick-start.md#installation)安装了所需的组件。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:9
msgid ""
"The recommended way to migrate a `go/v3` project is to create a new `go/v4` "
"project and copy over the API and the reconciliation code. The conversion "
"will end up with a project that looks like a native go/v4 project layout "
"(latest version)."
msgstr "迁移 `go/v3` 项目的推荐方法是创建一个新的 `go/v4` 项目，并将 API 和协调代码复制过去。转换后的项目将呈现出原生 `go/v4` 项目布局的样子（最新版本）。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:16
msgid ""
"To upgrade your project you might want to use the command `kubebuilder alpha "
"generate [OPTIONS]`. This command will re-scaffold the project using the "
"current Kubebuilder version. You can run `kubebuilder alpha generate --"
"plugins=go/v4` to regenerate your project using `go/v4` based in your "
"[PROJECT](../reference/project-config.md) file config. ([More info](./../"
"reference/rescaffold.md))"
msgstr "要升级您的项目，您可能需要使用命令 `kubebuilder alpha generate [OPTIONS]`。该命令将使用当前的 Kubebuilder 版本重新构建项目。您可以运行 `kubebuilder alpha generate --plugins=go/v4`，根据您的 [PROJECT](../reference/project-config.md) 文件配置使用 `go/v4` 重新生成您的项目。（[更多信息](./../reference/rescaffold.md)）"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:23
msgid ""
"However, in some cases, it's possible to do an in-place upgrade (i.e. reuse "
"the go/v3 project layout, upgrading the PROJECT file, and scaffolds "
"manually). For further information see [Migration from go/v3 to go/v4 by "
"updating the files manually](manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md)"
msgstr "然而，在某些情况下，可以进行就地升级（即重用 go/v3 项目布局，手动升级 PROJECT 文件和脚手架）。有关更多信息，请参见 [通过手动更新文件从 go/v3 迁移到 go/v4](manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md)。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:26
msgid "Initialize a go/v4 Project"
msgstr "初始化一个 go/v4 项目"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:43
msgid ""
"Now, we need to initialize a go/v4 project.  Before we do that, we'll need "
"to initialize a new go module if we're not on the `GOPATH`. While "
"technically this is not needed inside `GOPATH`, it is still recommended."
msgstr "现在，我们需要初始化一个 go/v4 项目。在此之前，如果我们不在 `GOPATH` 中，我们需要初始化一个新的 go 模块。虽然从技术上讲，在 `GOPATH` 内部并不需要，但仍然推荐这样做。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:60
msgid "Now, we can finish initializing the project with kubebuilder."
msgstr "现在，我们可以使用 kubebuilder 完成项目的初始化。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:96
msgid ""
"Please run `kubebuilder edit --multigroup=true` to enable multi-group "
"support before migrating the APIs and controllers. Please see [this](multi-"
"group.md) for more details."
msgstr "请运行 `kubebuilder edit --multigroup=true` 以启用多组支持，然后再迁移 APIs 和控制器。有关更多详细信息，请参阅 [此处](multi-group.md)。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:106
msgid ""
"Now, let's migrate the controller code from `controllers/cronjob_controller."
"go` in our old project to `internal/controller/cronjob_controller.go` in the "
"new one."
msgstr "现在，让我们将旧项目中 `controllers/cronjob_controller.go` 的控制器代码迁移到新项目中的 `internal/controller/cronjob_controller.go`。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:129
msgid ""
"If there are any manual updates in `main.go` in v3, we need to port the "
"changes to the new `main.go`. We’ll also need to ensure all of needed "
"controller-runtime `schemes` have been registered."
msgstr "如果在 v3 的 `main.go` 中有任何手动更新，我们需要将这些更改迁移到新的 `main.go` 中。我们还需要确保所有需要的 controller-runtime `schemes` 都已注册。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:131
msgid ""
"If there are additional manifests added under config directory, port them as "
"well. Please, be aware that the new version go/v4 uses Kustomize v5x and no "
"longer Kustomize v4. Therefore, if added customized implementations in the "
"config you need to ensure that they can work with Kustomize v5 and if not "
"update/upgrade any breaking change that you might face."
msgstr "如果在配置目录下添加了其他清单，请一并移植。请注意，新版本的 go/v4 使用 Kustomize v5.x，而不再是 Kustomize v4。因此，如果在配置中添加了自定义实现，您需要确保它们能够与 Kustomize v5 一起使用，如果不能，则需要更新/升级您可能遇到的任何破坏性更改。"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:136
msgid ""
"In v4, installation of Kustomize has been changed from bash script to `go "
"get`. Change the `kustomize` dependency in Makefile to"
msgstr "在 v4 中，Kustomize 的安装方式已经从 bash 脚本更改为 `go get`。请将 Makefile 中的 `kustomize` 依赖更改为"

#: src/migration/migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:137
msgid ""
"```\n"
".PHONY: kustomize\n"
"kustomize: $(KUSTOMIZE) ## Download kustomize locally if necessary. If wrong "
"version is installed, it will be removed before downloading.\n"
"$(KUSTOMIZE): $(LOCALBIN)\n"
"\t@if test -x $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize && ! $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize version | "
"grep -q $(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION); then \\\n"
"\t\techo \"$(LOCALBIN)/kustomize version is not expected "
"$(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION). Removing it before installing.\"; \\\n"
"\t\trm -rf $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize; \\\n"
"\tfi\n"
"\ttest -s $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize || GOBIN=$(LOCALBIN) GO111MODULE=on go "
"install sigs.k8s.io/kustomize/kustomize/v5@$(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION)\n"
"```"
msgstr "```
.PHONY: kustomize
kustomize: $(KUSTOMIZE) ## 如果有必要，下载 kustomize 到本地。如果安装了错误的版本，它将在下载前被移除。
$(KUSTOMIZE): $(LOCALBIN)
	@if test -x $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize && ! $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize version | grep -q $(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION); then \ 
		echo "安装的 $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize 版本不是预期的 $(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION)。在安装前将其移除。"; \ 
		rm -rf $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize; \ 
	fi
	test -s $(LOCALBIN)/kustomize || GOBIN=$(LOCALBIN) GO111MODULE=on go install sigs.k8s.io/kustomize/kustomize/v5@$(KUSTOMIZE_VERSION)
```"

#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:1
msgid "Migration from go/v3 to go/v4 by updating the files manually"
msgstr "通过手动更新文件进行从 go/v3 到 go/v4 的迁移。"

#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:9
msgid ""
"The following guide describes the manual steps required to upgrade your "
"PROJECT config file to begin using `go/v4`."
msgstr "以下指南描述了升级您的 PROJECT 配置文件以开始使用 `go/v4` 所需的手动步骤。"

#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:13
msgid ""
"Usually it is suggested to do it manually if you have customized your "
"project and deviated too much from the proposed scaffold. Before continuing, "
"ensure that you understand the note about \\[project "
"customizations\\]\\[project-customizations\\]. Note that you might need to "
"spend more effort to do this process manually than to organize your project "
"customizations. The proposed layout will keep your project maintainable and "
"upgradable with less effort in the future."
msgstr "通常建议如果您对项目进行了自定义并偏离了建议的框架，最好手动操作。在继续之前，请确保您理解关于 \\[项目自定义\\]\\[project-customizations\\] 的说明。请注意，您可能需要花费比整理项目自定义更多的精力来手动完成此过程。建议的布局将使您的项目在未来更易于维护和升级，所需的努力也会更少。"

#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:15
msgid ""
"The recommended upgrade approach is to follow the [Migration Guide go/v3 to "
"go/v4](migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md) instead."
msgstr "推荐的升级方法是遵循 [从 go/v3 到 go/v4 的迁移指南](migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md)。"

#: src/migration/manually_migration_guide_gov3_to_gov4.md:17
