#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:5
msgid ""
"Please note that all input utilized via the Kubebuilder tool is tracked in "
"the PROJECT file ([example](./../../../../testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/"
"PROJECT)). This file is responsible for storing essential information, "
"representing various facets of the Project such as its layout, plugins, "
"APIs, and more. ([More info](./../reference/project-config.md))."
msgstr "请注意，通过 Kubebuilder 工具使用的所有输入都记录在 PROJECT 文件中（[示例](./../../../../testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/PROJECT)）。该文件负责存储重要信息，代表项目的各个方面，例如其布局、插件、API 等。（[更多信息](./../reference/project-config.md)）。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:9
msgid ""
"With the release of new plugin versions/layouts or even a new Kubebuilder "
"CLI version with scaffold changes, an easy way to upgrade your project is by "
"re-scaffolding. This process allows users to employ tools like IDEs to "
"compare changes, enabling them to overlay their code implementation on the "
"new scaffold or integrate these changes into their existing projects."
msgstr "随着新插件版本/布局或甚至新的 Kubebuilder CLI 版本的发布，升级项目的一种简单方法是重新搭建框架。这个过程允许用户使用 IDE 等工具比较变化，使他们能够将自己的代码实现叠加在新的框架上，或将这些变化整合到他们现有的项目中。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:13 src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:16
msgid "When to use it ?"
msgstr "何时使用它？"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:15
msgid ""
"This command is useful when you want to upgrade an existing project to the "
"latest version of the Kubebuilder project layout. It makes it easier for the "
"users to migrate their operator projects to the new scaffolding."
msgstr "此命令在您希望将现有项目升级到最新版本的 Kubebuilder 项目布局时非常有用。它使用户更容易将他们的操作项目迁移到新的脚手架。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:18 src/plugins/available/go-v4-plugin.md:21
#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:22
#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:40
