"**To upgrade the scaffold of your project to use a new plugin version:**"
msgstr "**要将您的项目脚手架升级为使用新插件版本：**"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:23
msgid "\"pluginkey/version\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:26
msgid "**To upgrade the scaffold of your project to get the latest changes:**"
msgstr "**要升级您项目的脚手架以获取最新更改：**"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:28
msgid ""
"Currently, it supports two optional params, `input-dir` and `output-dir`."
msgstr "目前，它支持两个可选参数，`input-dir` 和 `output-dir`。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:30
msgid ""
"`input-dir` is the path to the existing project that you want to re-"
"scaffold. Default is the current working directory."
msgstr "`input-dir` 是您想要重新构建的现有项目的路径。默认值为当前工作目录。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:32
msgid ""
"`output-dir` is the path to the directory where you want to generate the new "
"project. Default is a subdirectory in the current working directory."
msgstr "`output-dir` 是您希望生成新项目的目录路径。默认是在当前工作目录下的一个子目录。"

#: src/reference/rescaffold.md:41
msgid ""
"If neither `input-dir` nor `output-dir` are specified, the project will be "
"regenerated in the current directory. This approach facilitates comparison "
"between your current local branch and the version stored upstream (e.g., "
"GitHub main branch). This way, you can easily overlay your project's code "
"changes atop the new scaffold."
msgstr "如果既没有指定 `input-dir` 也没有指定 `output-dir`，项目将会在当前目录下重新生成。此方法便于将您当前的本地分支与存储在上游的版本（例如，GitHub 主分支）进行比较。通过这种方式，您可以轻松地将项目的代码更改叠加到新的脚手架之上。"

