#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:3
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder uses a tool called [`controller-gen`](https://sigs.k8s.io/"
"controller-tools \"Controller Tools\") to generate utility code and "
"Kubernetes object YAML, like CustomResourceDefinitions."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 使用一个名为 [`controller-gen`](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools "Controller Tools") 的工具来生成实用代码和 Kubernetes 对象的 YAML，比如自定义资源定义（CustomResourceDefinitions）。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:7
msgid ""
"To do this, it makes use of special \"marker comments\" (comments that start "
"with `// +`) to indicate additional information about fields, types, and "
"packages.  In the case of CRDs, these are generally pulled from your `_types."
"go` files.  For more information on markers, see the [marker reference docs]"
"(./markers.md \"Markers for Config/Code Generation\")."
msgstr "为此，它使用特殊的“标记注释”（以 `// +` 开头的注释）来指示有关字段、类型和包的附加信息。在自定义资源定义（CRD）的情况下，这些信息通常来自于你的 `_types.go` 文件。有关标记的更多信息，请参见 [标记参考文档](./markers.md "配置/代码生成的标记")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:13
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder provides a `make` target to run controller-gen and generate "
"CRDs: `make manifests`."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了一个 `make` 目标来运行 controller-gen 并生成 CRD：`make manifests`。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:16
msgid ""
"When you run `make manifests`, you should see CRDs generated under the "
"`config/crd/bases` directory.  `make manifests` can generate a number of "
"other artifacts as well -- see the [marker reference docs](./markers.md "
"\"Markers for Config/Code Generation\") for more details."
msgstr "当你运行 `make manifests` 时，应该可以在 `config/crd/bases` 目录下看到生成的 CRD。`make manifests` 还可以生成许多其他的构件—更多细节请查看 [标记参考文档](./markers.md "配置/代码生成的标记")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:21
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:23
msgid ""
"CRDs support [declarative validation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/"
"access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/"
"#validation \"Custom Resource Definitions: Validation\") using an [OpenAPI "
"v3 schema](https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/"
"versions/3.0.0.md#schemaObject \"OpenAPI v3\") in the `validation` section."
msgstr "CRD 支持使用 `validation` 部分中的 [OpenAPI v3 架构](https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/3.0.0.md#schemaObject "OpenAPI v3") 进行 [声明式验证](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#validation "自定义资源定义：验证")."

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:26
msgid ""
"In general, [validation markers](./markers/crd-validation.md) may be "
"attached to fields or to types. If you're defining complex validation, if "
"you need to re-use validation, or if you need to validate slice elements, "
"it's often best to define a new type to describe your validation."
msgstr "一般来说，[验证标记](./markers/crd-validation.md)可以附加到字段或类型上。如果您在定义复杂的验证、需要重用验证或需要验证切片元素，通常最好定义一个新类型来描述您的验证。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:31 src/reference/generating-crd.md:107
#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:128 src/reference/metrics.md:315
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:35
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxLength=15\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinLength=1\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxLength=15\n\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinLength=1\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:37
msgid "`json:\"name,omitempty\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:39
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxItems=500\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinItems=1\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:UniqueItems=true\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxItems=500\n\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinItems=1\n\t// +kubebuilder:validation:UniqueItems=true\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:42
msgid "`json:\"knights,omitempty\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:44
msgid "`json:\"alias,omitempty\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:45
msgid "`json:\"rank\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:47
msgid "// +kubebuilder:validation:Enum=Lion;Wolf;Dragon\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:validation:Enum=狮子;狼;龙\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:50
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Minimum=1\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Maximum=3\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:ExclusiveMaximum=false\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:validation:最小值=1\n// +kubebuilder:validation:最大值=3\n// +kubebuilder:validation:排除最大值=false\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:58
msgid "Additional Printer Columns"
msgstr "附加打印机列"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:60
msgid ""
"Starting with Kubernetes 1.11, `kubectl get` can ask the server what columns "
"to display.  For CRDs, this can be used to provide useful, type-specific "
"information with `kubectl get`, similar to the information provided for "
"built-in types."
msgstr "从 Kubernetes 1.11 开始，`kubectl get` 可以向服务器请求显示哪些列。对于自定义资源定义（CRD），这可以用于提供有用的特定类型信息，类似于内置类型所提供的信息。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:65
msgid ""
"The information that gets displayed can be controlled with the "
"[additionalPrinterColumns field](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-"
"kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#additional-"
"printer-columns \"Custom Resource Definitions: Additional Printer Columns\") "
"on your CRD, which is controlled by the [`+kubebuilder:printcolumn`](./"
"markers/crd.md \"CRD Generation\") marker on the Go type for your CRD."
msgstr "显示的信息可以通过您的 CRD 上的 [additionalPrinterColumns 字段](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#additional-printer-columns \"自定义资源定义：附加打印列\") 进行控制，该字段由 CRD 的 Go 类型上的 [`+kubebuilder:printcolumn`](./markers/crd.md \"CRD 生成\") 标记控制。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:71
msgid ""
"For instance, in the following example, we add fields to display information "
"about the knights, rank, and alias fields from the validation example:"
msgstr "例如，在以下示例中，我们添加字段以显示有关骑士的信息，以及来自验证示例的等级和别名字段："

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:76
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Alias\",type=string,JSONPath=`.spec."
"alias`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Rank\",type=integer,JSONPath=`.spec."
"rank`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Bravely Run Away\",type=boolean,"
"JSONPath=`.spec.knights[?(@ == \"Sir Robin\")]`,description=\"when danger "
"rears its ugly head, he bravely turned his tail and fled\",priority=10\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Age\",type=\"date\",JSONPath=\".metadata."
"creationTimestamp\"\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"别名\",type=string,JSONPath=`.spec.alias`\n// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"等级\",type=integer,JSONPath=`.spec.rank`\n// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"勇敢逃跑\",type=boolean,JSONPath=`.spec.knights[?(@ == \"罗宾爵士\")]`,description=\"当危险抬起丑陋的头颅时，他勇敢地转身逃跑\",priority=10\n// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"年龄\",type=\"日期\",JSONPath=\".metadata.creationTimestamp\"\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:90
msgid "Subresources"
msgstr "子资源"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:92
msgid ""
"CRDs can choose to implement the `/status` and `/scale` [subresources]"
"(https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/"
"custom-resource-definitions/#status-subresource \"Custom Resource "
"Definitions: Status Subresource\") as of Kubernetes 1.13."
msgstr "从 Kubernetes 1.13 开始，CRDs 可以选择实现 `/status` 和 `/scale` [子资源](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#status-subresource \"自定义资源定义：状态子资源\")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:95
msgid ""
"It's generally recommended that you make use of the `/status` subresource on "
"all resources that have a status field."
msgstr "一般建议您在所有具有状态字段的资源中使用 `/status` 子资源。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:98
msgid ""
"Both subresources have a corresponding [marker](./markers/crd.md \"CRD "
"Generation\")."
msgstr "两个子资源都有相应的 [标记](./markers/crd.md \"CRD 生成\")."

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:100
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:102
msgid ""
"The status subresource is enabled via `+kubebuilder:subresource:status`. "
"When enabled, updates at the main resource will not change status. "
"Similarly, updates to the status subresource cannot change anything but the "
"status field."
msgstr "状态子资源是通过 `+kubebuilder:subresource:status` 启用的。当启用时，主资源的更新不会更改状态。同样，状态子资源的更新只能更改状态字段，不能更改其他内容。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:110
msgid "// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:120
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "规模"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:122
msgid ""
"The scale subresource is enabled via `+kubebuilder:subresource:scale`. When "
"enabled, users will be able to use `kubectl scale` with your resource.  If "
"the `selectorpath` argument pointed to the string form of a label selector, "
"the HorizontalPodAutoscaler will be able to autoscale your resource."
msgstr "通过 `+kubebuilder:subresource:scale` 启用 scale 子资源。启用后，用户将能够使用 `kubectl scale` 命令来缩放您的资源。如果 `selectorpath` 参数指向标签选择器的字符串形式，则水平 Pod 自动扩缩器 (HorizontalPodAutoscaler) 将能够对您的资源进行自动扩缩。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:132 src/reference/generating-crd.md:136
msgid "`json:\"replicas\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:137
msgid "`json:\"selector\"` // this must be the string form of the selector\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:140
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"
"// +kubebuilder:subresource:scale:specpath=.spec.replicas,statuspath=.status."
"replicas,selectorpath=.status.selector\n"
msgstr "// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n// +kubebuilder:subresource:scale:specpath=.spec.replicas,statuspath=.status.replicas,selectorpath=.status.selector\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:152
msgid "Multiple Versions"
msgstr "多个版本"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:154
msgid ""
"As of Kubernetes 1.13, you can have multiple versions of your Kind defined "
"in your CRD, and use a webhook to convert between them."
msgstr "从 Kubernetes 1.13 开始，您可以在 CRD 中定义多个版本的 Kind，并使用一个 webhook 在它们之间进行转换。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:157
msgid ""
"For more details on this process, see the [multiversion tutorial](/"
"multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md)."
msgstr "有关此过程的更多详细信息，请参见 [多版本教程](/multiversion-tutorial/tutorial.md)。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:160
msgid ""
"By default, Kubebuilder disables generating different validation for "
"different versions of the Kind in your CRD, to be compatible with older "
"Kubernetes versions."
msgstr "默认情况下，Kubebuilder 禁用了为 CRD 中的 Kind 不同版本生成不同的验证，以便与旧版本的 Kubernetes 兼容。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:164
msgid ""
"You'll need to enable this by switching the line in your makefile that says "
"`CRD_OPTIONS ?= \"crd:trivialVersions=true,preserveUnknownFields=false` to "
"`CRD_OPTIONS ?= crd:preserveUnknownFields=false` if using v1beta CRDs, and "
"`CRD_OPTIONS ?= crd` if using v1 (recommended)."
msgstr "如果使用 v1beta CRD，您需要将 makefile 中的 `CRD_OPTIONS ?= \"crd:trivialVersions=true,preserveUnknownFields=false` 这一行更改为 `CRD_OPTIONS ?= crd:preserveUnknownFields=false`；如果使用 v1（推荐），则更改为 `CRD_OPTIONS ?= crd`。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:169
