msgstr ""

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:60
msgid ""
"// Set the ownerRef for the Deployment, ensuring that the Deployment\n"
"    // will be deleted when the Busybox CR is deleted.\n"
msgstr "// 设置 Deployment 的 ownerRef，确保在删除 Busybox CR 时，Deployment 也会被删除。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:67
#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:70
#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:107
msgid "Explanation"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:69
msgid ""
"By setting the `OwnerReference`, if the `Busybox` resource is deleted, "
"Kubernetes will automatically delete the `Deployment` as well. This also "
"allows the controller to watch for changes in the `Deployment` and ensure "
"that the desired state (such as the number of replicas) is maintained."
msgstr "通过设置 `OwnerReference`，如果 `Busybox` 资源被删除，Kubernetes 会自动删除 `Deployment`。这还允许控制器监视 `Deployment` 的变化，并确保维护所需的状态（例如副本数）。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:73
msgid ""
"For example, if someone modifies the `Deployment` to change the replica "
"count to 3, while the `Busybox` CR defines the desired state as 1 replica, "
"the controller will reconcile this and ensure the `Deployment` is scaled "
"back to 1 replica."
msgstr "例如，如果有人修改了 `Deployment`，将副本数更改为 3，而 `Busybox` CR 定义的期望状态为 1 个副本，控制器将进行协调，确保 `Deployment` 缩减回 1 个副本。"

