#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:1
msgid "Using Predicates to Refine Watches"
msgstr "使用谓词来优化手表"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:3
msgid ""
"When working with controllers, it's often beneficial to use **Predicates** "
"to filter events and control when the reconciliation loop should be "
"triggered."
msgstr "在使用控制器时，使用 **谓词** 来过滤事件和控制何时触发协调循环通常是有益的。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:6
msgid ""
"[Predicates](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/"
"source#WithPredicates) allow you to define conditions based on events (such "
"as create, update, or delete) and resource fields (such as labels, "
"annotations, or status fields). By using **[Predicates](https://pkg.go.dev/"
"sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**, you can refine "
"your controller’s behavior to respond only to specific changes in the "
"resources it watches."
msgstr "[谓词](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates) 允许您基于事件（例如创建、更新或删除）和资源字段（例如标签、注释或状态字段）定义条件。通过使用 **[谓词](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**，您可以细化控制器的行为，使其仅对所观察资源的特定变化做出响应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:11
msgid ""
"This can be especially useful when you want to refine which changes in "
"resources should trigger a reconciliation. By using predicates, you avoid "
"unnecessary reconciliations and can ensure that the controller only reacts "
"to relevant changes."
msgstr "这在你想要细化哪些资源的变化应该触发调和时尤其有用。通过使用谓词，你可以避免不必要的调和，并确保控制器仅对相关变化做出反应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:16
msgid "When to Use Predicates"
msgstr "何时使用谓词"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:18
msgid "**Predicates are useful when:**"
msgstr "**谓词在以下情况下很有用：**"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:20
msgid ""
"You want to ignore certain changes, such as updates that don't impact the "
"fields your controller is concerned with."
msgstr "您想忽略某些更改，例如那些不影响控制器关注的字段的更新。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:21
msgid ""
"You want to trigger reconciliation only for resources with specific labels "
"or annotations."
msgstr "您只想对具有特定标签或注释的资源触发协调。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:22
msgid ""
"You want to watch external resources and react only to specific changes."
msgstr "您希望监视外部资源，并仅对特定更改做出反应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:24
msgid "Example: Using Predicates to Filter Update Events"
msgstr "示例：使用谓词过滤更新事件"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:26
msgid ""
"Let’s say that we only want our **`BackupBusybox`** controller to reconcile "
"when certain fields of the **`Busybox`** resource change, for example, when "
"the `spec.size` field changes, but we want to ignore all other changes (such "
"as status updates)."
msgstr "假设我们只希望我们的 **`BackupBusybox`** 控制器在 **`Busybox`** 资源的某些字段发生变化时进行协调，例如，当 `spec.size` 字段发生变化时，但我们希望忽略所有其他变化（如状态更新）。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:30
msgid "Defining a Predicate"
msgstr "定义谓词"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:32
msgid ""
"In the following example, we define a predicate that only allows "
"reconciliation when there’s a meaningful update to the **`Busybox`** "
"resource:"
msgstr "在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个谓词，仅在对 **`Busybox`** 资源有重要更新时才允许调和："

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:38
msgid "\"sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/predicate\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:39
msgid "\"sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/event\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:41
msgid ""
"// Predicate to trigger reconciliation only on size changes in the Busybox "
"spec\n"
msgstr "// 仅在 Busybox 规格的大小变化时触发重新协调的谓词\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:44
msgid ""
"// Only allow updates when the spec.size of the Busybox resource changes\n"
msgstr "// 仅在 Busybox 资源的 spec.size 发生变化时允许更新\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:49
msgid "// Trigger reconciliation only if the spec.size field has changed\n"
msgstr "// 仅在 spec.size 字段发生变化时触发重新调和"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:53
msgid "// Allow create events\n"
msgstr "// 允许创建事件\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:58
msgid "// Allow delete events\n"
msgstr "// 允许删除事件\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:63
msgid "// Allow generic events (e.g., external triggers)\n"
msgstr "// 允许通用事件（例如，外部触发）\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:72
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "在这个例子中："

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:73
msgid ""
"The **`UpdateFunc`** returns `true` only if the **`spec.size`** field has "
"changed between the old and new objects, meaning that all other changes in "
"the `spec`, like annotations or other fields, will be ignored."
msgstr "**`UpdateFunc`** 仅在 **`spec.size`** 字段在旧对象和新对象之间发生变化时返回 `true`，这意味着在 `spec` 中的其他所有更改（例如注释或其他字段）将被忽略。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:74
msgid ""
"**`CreateFunc`**, **`DeleteFunc`**, and **`GenericFunc`** return `true`, "
"meaning that create, delete, and generic events are still processed, "
"allowing reconciliation to happen for these event types."
msgstr "**`CreateFunc`**、**`DeleteFunc`** 和 **`GenericFunc`** 返回 `true`，意味着创建、删除和通用事件仍然被处理，从而允许这些事件类型的协调发生。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:76
msgid ""
"This ensures that the controller reconciles only when the specific field "
"**`spec.size`** is modified, while ignoring any other modifications in the "
"`spec` that are irrelevant to your logic."
msgstr "这确保了只有在特定字段 **`spec.size`** 被修改时，控制器才会进行协调，而忽略 `spec` 中与您的逻辑无关的其他修改。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:78
msgid "Example: Using Predicates in `Watches`"
msgstr "示例：在`Watches`中使用谓词"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:80
msgid ""
"Now, we apply this predicate in the **`Watches()`** method of the "
"**`BackupBusyboxReconciler`** to trigger reconciliation only for relevant "
"events:"
msgstr "现在，我们将这个谓词应用在 **`BackupBusyboxReconciler`** 的 **`Watches()`** 方法中，以便仅针对相关事件触发重新调和："

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:84
msgid ""
"// SetupWithManager sets up the controller with the Manager.\n"
"// The controller will watch both the BackupBusybox primary resource and the "
"Busybox resource, using predicates.\n"
msgstr "// SetupWithManager 使用 Manager 设置控制器。\n// 控制器将同时监视 BackupBusybox 主要资源和 Busybox 资源，并使用谓词。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:101
msgid "// Apply the predicate\n"
msgstr "// 应用谓词"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:102
msgid ""
"// Trigger reconciliation when the Busybox resource changes (if it meets "
"predicate conditions)\n"
msgstr "// 当 Busybox 资源发生变化时触发协调（如果符合谓词条件）\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:109
msgid ""
"**[`builder.WithPredicates(updatePred)`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/"
"controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**: This method applies the "
"predicate, ensuring that reconciliation only occurs when the **`spec.size`** "
"field in **`Busybox`** changes."
msgstr "**[`builder.WithPredicates(updatePred)`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**：此方法应用谓词，确保只有在 **`Busybox`** 中 **`spec.size`** 字段发生变化时才会进行调解。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:111
msgid ""
"**Other Events**: The controller will still trigger reconciliation on "
"`Create`, `Delete`, and `Generic` events."
msgstr "**其他事件**：控制器仍将在 `创建`、`删除` 和 `通用` 事件上触发协调。"

