"For further guidance, you can refer to examples in the `testdata/` directory "
"in the Kubebuilder repository."
msgstr "有关进一步的指导，您可以参考 Kubebuilder 存储库中的 `testdata/` 目录中的示例。"

#: src/reference/markers/scaffold.md:161
msgid ""
"**Alternatively**: You can use the [`alpha generate`](./../rescaffold.md) "
"command to re-generate the project from scratch using the latest release "
"available. Afterward, you can re-add only your code implementation on top to "
"ensure your project includes all the latest bug fixes and enhancements."
msgstr "**另外**：您可以使用 [`alpha generate`](./../rescaffold.md) 命令从头开始重新生成项目，使用最新的可用版本。之后，您可以重新添加仅包含您的代码实现，以确保您的项目包含所有最新的 bug 修复和增强功能。"

#: src/reference/markers/scaffold.md:170
msgid ""
"If you are using Kubebuilder as a library to create [your own plugins]"
"(./../../plugins/creating-plugins.md) and extend its CLI functionalities, "
"you have the flexibility to define and use your own markers. To implement "
"your own markers, refer to the [kubebuilder/v4/pkg/machinery](https://pkg.go."
"dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/machinery), which provides tools to "
"create and manage markers effectively."
msgstr "如果您正在使用 Kubebuilder 作为库来创建 [您自己的插件](./../../plugins/creating-plugins.md) 并扩展其 CLI 功能，您可以灵活地定义和使用您自己的标记。要实现您自己的标记，请参考 [kubebuilder/v4/pkg/machinery](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/machinery)，该模块提供了有效创建和管理标记的工具。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:3
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder makes use of a tool called [controller-gen](https://sigs.k8s.io/"
"controller-tools/cmd/controller-gen) for generating utility code and "
"Kubernetes YAML.  This code and config generation is controlled by the "
"presence of special [\"marker comments\"](/reference/markers.md) in Go code."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 使用一个名为 [controller-gen](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools/cmd/controller-gen) 的工具来生成实用代码和 Kubernetes YAML。此代码和配置的生成通过 Go 代码中的特殊 [“标记注释”](/reference/markers.md) 来控制。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:9
msgid ""
"controller-gen is built out of different \"generators\" (which specify what "
"to generate) and \"output rules\" (which specify how and where to write the "
"results)."
msgstr "controller-gen 是由不同的“生成器”（指定要生成的内容）和“输出规则”（指定如何以及在何处写入结果）构建而成的。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:13
msgid ""
"Both are configured through command line options specified in [marker format]"
"(/reference/markers.md)."
msgstr "两者都通过在 [标记格式](/reference/markers.md) 中指定的命令行选项进行配置。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:16
msgid "For instance, the following command:"
msgstr "例如，以下命令："

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:22
msgid ""
"generates CRDs and RBAC, and specifically stores the generated CRD YAML in "
"`config/crd/bases`.  For the RBAC, it uses the default output rules (`config/"
"rbac`).  It considers every package in the current directory tree (as per "
"the normal rules of the go `...` wildcard)."
msgstr "生成 CRD 和 RBAC，并将生成的 CRD YAML 特别存储在 `config/crd/bases` 中。对于 RBAC，它使用默认的输出规则（`config/rbac`）。它会考虑当前目录树中的每个包（根据 Go `...` 通配符的正常规则）。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:27
msgid "Generators"
msgstr "发电机"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:29
msgid ""
"Each different generator is configured through a CLI option.  Multiple "
"generators may be used in a single invocation of `controller-gen`."
msgstr "每个不同的生成器通过命令行选项进行配置。多个生成器可以在一次`controller-gen`的调用中使用。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:32
msgid "{{#markerdocs CLI: generators}}"
msgstr "您训练的数据截止到2023年10月。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:34
msgid "Output Rules"
msgstr "输出规则"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:36
msgid ""
"Output rules configure how a given generator outputs its results. There is "
"always one global \"fallback\" output rule (specified as `output:<rule>`), "
"plus per-generator overrides (specified as `output:<generator>:<rule>`)."
msgstr "输出规则配置了给定生成器如何输出其结果。始终有一个全局的“回退”输出规则（指定为 `output:<rule>`），加上每个生成器的覆盖规则（指定为 `output:<generator>:<rule>`）。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:44
msgid ""
"When no fallback rule is specified manually, a set of default per-generator "
"rules are used which result in YAML going to `config/<generator>`, and code "
"staying where it belongs."
msgstr "当未手动指定回退规则时，系统会使用一组默认的每个生成器规则，这些规则会将 YAML 文件放置在 `config/<generator>` 目录中，而代码则保持在原来的位置。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:48
msgid ""
"The default rules are equivalent to `output:<generator>:artifacts:"
"config=config/<generator>` for each generator."
msgstr "默认规则等价于 `output:<generator>:artifacts:config=config/<generator>` 对于每个生成器。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:52
msgid ""
"When a \"fallback\" rule is specified, that'll be used instead of the "
"default rules."
msgstr "当指定“后备”规则时，将使用该规则代替默认规则。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:55
msgid ""
"For example, if you specify `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:"
"stdout`, you'll get CRDs on standard out, and rbac in a file in `config/"
"rbac`. If you were to add in a global rule instead, like `crd rbac:"
"roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout output:none`, you'd get CRDs to "
"standard out, and everything else to /dev/null, because we've explicitly "
"specified a fallback."
msgstr "例如，如果您指定 `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout`，您将获得标准输出上的 CRD，以及在 `config/rbac` 中的 rbac 文件。如果您改为添加全局规则，例如 `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout output:none`，您将获得标准输出上的 CRD，而其他一切将输出到 /dev/null，因为我们已明确指定了回退。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:64
msgid ""
"For brevity, the per-generator output rules (`output:<generator>:<rule>`) "
"are omitted below.  They are equivalent to the global fallback options "
"listed here."
msgstr "为简洁起见，下面省略了每个生成器的输出规则（`output:<generator>:<rule>`）。它们等同于此处列出的全局后备选项。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:68
msgid ""
"{{#markerdocs CLI: output rules (optionally as output:<generator>:...)}}"
msgstr "{{#markerdocs CLI: 输出规则 （可选作为 output:<generator>:...）}}"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:70
msgid "Other Options"
msgstr "其他选项"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:72
msgid "{{#markerdocs CLI: generic}}"
msgstr "{{#markerdocs CLI: 通用}}"

#: src/reference/completion.md:1
msgid "Enabling shell autocompletion"
msgstr "启用 shell 自动补全"

#: src/reference/completion.md:2
msgid ""
"The Kubebuilder completion script can be generated with the command "
"`kubebuilder completion [bash|fish|powershell|zsh]`. Note that sourcing the "
"completion script in your shell enables Kubebuilder autocompletion."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 完成脚本可以使用命令 `kubebuilder completion [bash|fish|powershell|zsh]` 生成。请注意，在您的 shell 中加载完成脚本可以启用 Kubebuilder 自动完成功能。"

#: src/reference/completion.md:8
msgid ""
"The completion Bash script depends on [bash-completion](https://github.com/"
"scop/bash-completion), which means that you have to install this software "
"first (you can test if you have bash-completion already installed). Also, "
"ensure that your Bash version is 4.1+."
msgstr "完成的 Bash 脚本依赖于 [bash-completion](https://github.com/scop/bash-completion)，这意味着您首先需要安装此软件（您可以测试一下是否已经安装了 bash-completion）。此外，请确保您的 Bash 版本为 4.1 及以上。"

#: src/reference/completion.md:13
msgid ""
"Once installed, go ahead and add the path `/usr/local/bin/bash` in the  `/"
"etc/shells`."
msgstr "安装完成后，请在 `/etc/shells` 中添加路径 `/usr/local/bin/bash`。"

