#: src/reference/platform.md:69
msgid ""
"2) (Recommended as a Best Practice) Ensure that node affinity expressions "
"are set to match the supported platforms"
msgstr "2) （建议作为最佳实践）确保节点亲和性表达式设置为匹配支持的平台。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:71
msgid ""
"Kubernetes provides a mechanism called [nodeAffinity](https://kubernetes.io/"
"docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/assign-pod-node/#node-affinity) which can "
"be used to limit the possible node targets where a pod can be scheduled. "
"This is especially important to ensure correct scheduling behavior in "
"clusters with nodes that span across multiple platforms (i.e. heterogeneous "
"clusters)."
msgstr "Kubernetes 提供了一种称为 [nodeAffinity](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/assign-pod-node/#node-affinity) 的机制，可以用来限制 pod 可以被调度到的可能节点目标。这在确保跨多个平台的节点（即异构集群）中正确调度行为时尤为重要。"

