#: src/reference/platform.md:141
msgid "Producing projects that support multiple platforms"
msgstr "制作支持多个平台的项目"

#: src/reference/platform.md:143
msgid ""
"You can use [`docker buildx`](https://docs.docker.com/build/buildx/) to "
"cross-compile via emulation ([QEMU](https://www.qemu.org/)) to build the "
"manager image. See that projects scaffold with the latest versions of "
"Kubebuilder have the Makefile target `docker-buildx`."
msgstr "你可以使用 [`docker buildx`](https://docs.docker.com/build/buildx/) 通过仿真（[QEMU](https://www.qemu.org/)）进行交叉编译，以构建管理者镜像。请注意，使用最新版本的 Kubebuilder 脚手架创建的项目具有 Makefile 目标 `docker-buildx`。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:146
msgid "**Example of Usage**"
msgstr "**使用示例**"

#: src/reference/platform.md:152
msgid ""
"Note that you need to ensure that all images and workloads required and used "
"by your project will provide the same support as recommended above, and that "
"you properly configure the [nodeAffinity](https://kubernetes.io/docs/"
"concepts/scheduling-eviction/assign-pod-node/#node-affinity) for all your "
"workloads. Therefore, ensure that you uncomment the following code in the "
"`config/manager/manager.yaml` file"
msgstr "请注意，您需要确保您的项目所需和使用的所有镜像和工作负载都能提供与上述推荐相同的支持，并且您需要为所有工作负载正确配置 [nodeAffinity](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/assign-pod-node/#node-affinity)。因此，请确保在 `config/manager/manager.yaml` 文件中取消注释以下代码。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:157
msgid ""
"# TODO(user): Uncomment the following code to configure the nodeAffinity "
"expression\n"
"# according to the platforms which are supported by your solution.\n"
"# It is considered best practice to support multiple architectures. You can\n"
"# build your manager image using the makefile target docker-buildx.\n"
"# affinity:\n"
"#   nodeAffinity:\n"
"#     requiredDuringSchedulingIgnoredDuringExecution:\n"
"#       nodeSelectorTerms:\n"
"#         - matchExpressions:\n"
"#           - key: kubernetes.io/arch\n"
"#             operator: In\n"
"#             values:\n"
"#               - amd64\n"
"#               - arm64\n"
"#               - ppc64le\n"
"#               - s390x\n"
"#           - key: kubernetes.io/os\n"
"#             operator: In\n"
"#             values:\n"
"#               - linux\n"
msgstr "# TODO(用户): 取消注释以下代码以根据您的解决方案支持的平台配置 nodeAffinity 表达式。\n# 支持多种架构被视为最佳实践。您可以使用 makefile 目标 docker-buildx 构建您的管理器镜像。\n# affinity:\n#   nodeAffinity:\n#     requiredDuringSchedulingIgnoredDuringExecution:\n#       nodeSelectorTerms:\n#         - matchExpressions:\n#           - key: kubernetes.io/arch\n#             operator: In\n#             values:\n#               - amd64\n#               - arm64\n#               - ppc64le\n#               - s390x\n#           - key: kubernetes.io/os\n#             operator: In\n#             values:\n#               - linux\n"

#: src/reference/platform.md:182
msgid ""
"You will probably want to automate the releases of your projects to ensure "
"that the images are always built for the same platforms. Note that "
"Goreleaser also supports [docker buildx](https://docs.docker.com/build/"
"buildx/). See its [documentation](https://goreleaser.com/customization/"
"docker/#use-a-specific-builder-with-docker-buildx) for more detail."
msgstr "您可能希望自动化您项目的发布，以确保图像始终为相同的平台构建。请注意，Goreleaser 还支持 [docker buildx](https://docs.docker.com/build/buildx/)。有关更多详细信息，请参阅其 [文档](https://goreleaser.com/customization/docker/#use-a-specific-builder-with-docker-buildx)。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:185
msgid ""
"Also, you may want to configure GitHub Actions, Prow jobs, or any other "
"solution that you use to build images to provide multi-platform support. "
"Note that you can also use other options like `docker manifest create` to "
"customize your solutions to achieve the same goals with other tools."
msgstr "此外，您可能希望配置 GitHub Actions、Prow 作业或您用来构建镜像的任何其他解决方案，以提供多平台支持。请注意，您还可以使用其他选项，例如 `docker manifest create`，以便自定义您的解决方案，通过其他工具实现相同的目标。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:189
msgid ""
"By using Docker and the target provided by default you should NOT change the "
"Dockerfile to use any specific GOOS and GOARCH to build the manager binary. "
"However, if you are looking for to customize the default scaffold and create "
"your own implementations you might want to give a look in the Golang [doc]"
"(https://go.dev/doc/install/source#environment) to knows its available "
"options."
msgstr "使用 Docker 和默认提供的目标，您不应修改 Dockerfile 以使用任何特定的 GOOS 和 GOARCH 来构建管理者二进制文件。然而，如果您希望自定义默认脚手架并创建自己的实现，您可能需要查看 Golang [文档](https://go.dev/doc/install/source#environment) 以了解可用的选项。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:197
msgid "Which (workload) images are created by default?"
msgstr "默认创建哪些（工作负载）映像？"

#: src/reference/platform.md:199
msgid "Projects created with the Kubebuilder CLI have two workloads which are:"
msgstr "使用Kubebuilder命令行界面创建的项目有两个工作负载，分别是："

#: src/reference/platform.md:201
msgid "Manager"
msgstr "经理"

#: src/reference/platform.md:203
msgid ""
"The container to run the manager implementation is configured in the `config/"
"manager/manager.yaml` file. This image is built with the Dockerfile file "
"scaffolded by default and contains the binary of the project   \n"
"which will be built via the command `go build -a -o manager main.go`."
msgstr "用于运行管理器实现的容器配置在`config/manager/manager.yaml`文件中。该镜像是通过默认生成的Dockerfile构建的，并包含通过命令`go build -a -o manager main.go`构建的项目二进制文件。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:207
msgid ""
"Note that when you run `make docker-build` OR `make docker-build "
"IMG=myregistry/myprojectname:<tag>` an image will be built from the client "
"host (local environment) and produce an image for the client os/arch, which "
"is commonly linux/amd64 or linux/arm64."
msgstr "请注意，当您运行 `make docker-build` 或 `make docker-build IMG=myregistry/myprojectname:<tag>` 时，将会从客户端主机（本地环境）构建一个映像，并生成适用于客户端操作系统/架构的映像，通常是 linux/amd64 或 linux/arm64。"

#: src/reference/platform.md:214
msgid ""
"If you are running from an Mac Os environment then, Docker also will "
"consider it as linux/$arch. Be aware that when, for example, is running Kind "
"on a Mac OS operational system the nodes will end up labeled with ` "
"kubernetes.io/os=linux`"
msgstr "如果您是在 Mac OS 环境下运行，那么 Docker 也会将其视为 linux/$arch。请注意，例如，当在 Mac OS 操作系统上运行 Kind 时，节点最终会标记为 `kubernetes.io/os=linux`。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:1
msgid "Monitoring Performance with Pprof"
msgstr "使用 Pprof 监控性能"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:3
msgid ""
"[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof), a Go profiling tool, helps "
"identify performance bottlenecks in areas like CPU and memory usage. It's "
"integrated with the controller-runtime library's HTTP server, enabling "
"profiling via HTTP endpoints. You can visualize the data using go tool "
"pprof. Since [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) is built into "
"controller-runtime, no separate installation is needed. [Manager options]"
"(https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager) make it easy "
"to enable pprof and gather runtime metrics to optimize controller "
"performance."
msgstr "[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) 是一个 Go 性能分析工具，帮助识别 CPU 和内存使用等方面的性能瓶颈。它与 controller-runtime 库的 HTTP 服务器集成，允许通过 HTTP 端点进行性能分析。您可以使用 `go tool pprof` 可视化数据。由于 [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) 已内置于 controller-runtime 中，因此不需要单独安装。[管理器选项](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager) 使启用 pprof 和收集运行时指标变得简单，从而优化控制器性能。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:8
msgid ""
"While [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) is an excellent tool for "
"profiling and debugging, it is not recommended to leave it enabled in "
"production environments. The primary reasons are:"
msgstr "虽然[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof)是一个优秀的性能分析和调试工具，但不建议在生产环境中启用它。主要原因如下："

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:10
msgid ""
"**Security Risk**: The profiling endpoints expose detailed information about "
"your application's performance and resource usage, which could be exploited "
"if accessed by unauthorized users."
msgstr "**安全风险**：性能分析端点暴露了有关您应用程序的性能和资源使用的详细信息，如果被未经授权的用户访问，可能会被利用。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:11
msgid ""
"**Overhead**: Running profiling can introduce performance overhead, mainly "
"CPU usage, especially under heavy load, potentially impacting production "
"workloads."
msgstr "**开销**：运行性能分析可能会引入性能开销，主要是 CPU 使用率，尤其在高负载情况下，可能会影响生产工作负载。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:15
msgid "How to use Pprof?"
msgstr "如何使用 Pprof？"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:17
msgid "**Enabling Pprof**"
msgstr "**启用 Pprof**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:19
msgid "In your `cmd/main.go` file, add the field:"
msgstr "在您的`cmd/main.go`文件中，添加字段："

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:21
msgid ""
"```golang\n"
"mgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{\n"
"  ...\n"
"  // PprofBindAddress is the TCP address that the controller should bind to\n"
"  // for serving pprof. Specify the manager address and the port that should "
"be bind.\n"
"  PprofBindAddress:       \":8082\",\n"
"  ...\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr "```golang
mgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{
  ...
  // PprofBindAddress 是控制器应绑定以提供 pprof 的 TCP 地址
  // 指定管理器的地址和应绑定的端口。
  PprofBindAddress:       ":8082",
  ...
})
```"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:31
msgid "**Test It Out**"
msgstr "**试一试**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:33
msgid ""
"After enabling [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof), you need to build "
"and deploy your controller to test it out. Follow the steps in the [Quick "
"Start guide](../quick-start.md#test-it-out) to run your project locally or "
"on a cluster."
msgstr "在启用[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof)之后，您需要构建并部署您的控制器以进行测试。请按照[快速入门指南](../quick-start.md#test-it-out)中的步骤，在本地或集群上运行您的项目。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:35
msgid ""
"Then, you can apply your CRs/samples in order to monitor the performance of "
"its controllers."
msgstr "然后，您可以应用您的CRs/样本以监控其控制器的性能。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:37
msgid "**Exporting the data**"
msgstr "**导出数据**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:39
msgid "Using `curl`, export the profiling statistics to a file like this:"
msgstr "使用 `curl`，将性能统计导出到文件中，格式如下："

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:42
msgid "# Note that we are using the bind host and port configured via the\n"
msgstr "请注意，我们正在使用通过配置的绑定主机和端口。"

