msgid "# Manager Options in the cmd/main.go\n"
msgstr "# cmd/main.go 中的管理选项"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:44
msgid "\"http://127.0.0.1:8082/debug/pprof/profile\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:47
msgid "**Visualizing the results on Browser**"
msgstr "**在浏览器中可视化结果**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:50
msgid "# Go tool will open a session on port 8080.\n"
msgstr "# Go工具将在8080端口打开一个会话。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:51
msgid "# You can change this as per your own need.\n"
msgstr "# 你可以根据自己的需要进行更改。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:55
msgid ""
"Visualization results will vary depending on the deployed workload, and the "
"Controller's behavior. However, you'll see the result on your browser "
