#: src/reference/envtest.md:208
msgid ""
"EnvTest does not support namespace deletion. Deleting a namespace will seem "
"to succeed, but the namespace will just be put in a Terminating state, and "
"never actually be reclaimed. Trying to recreate the namespace will fail. "
"This will cause your reconciler to continue reconciling any objects left "
"behind, unless they are deleted."
msgstr "EnvTest不支持命名空间的删除。删除命名空间看似成功，但实际情况是该命名空间会处于终止状态，并且永远不会被回收。尝试重新创建该命名空间将会失败。这将导致您的协调器继续协调任何遗留的对象，除非它们被删除。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:210
msgid ""
"To overcome this limitation you can create a new namespace for each test. "
"Even so, when one test completes (e.g. in \"namespace-1\") and another test "
"starts (e.g. in \"namespace-2\"), the controller will still be reconciling "
"any active objects from \"namespace-1\". This can be avoided by ensuring "
"that all tests clean up after themselves as part of the test teardown.  If "
"teardown of a namespace is difficult, it may be possible to wire the "
"reconciler in such a way that it ignores reconcile requests that come from "
"namespaces other than the one being tested:"
msgstr "为了克服这一限制，您可以为每个测试创建一个新的命名空间。即便如此，当一个测试完成（例如在“namespace-1”中）而另一个测试开始（例如在“namespace-2”中）时，控制器仍会对“namespace-1”中的任何活动对象进行调和。通过确保所有测试在测试清理过程中进行自我清理，可以避免这种情况。如果命名空间的清理比较困难，可以考虑以某种方式配置调和器，使其忽略来自非测试命名空间的调和请求。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:216
msgid "// restrict namespaces to reconcile\n"
msgstr "// 限制命名空间以进行协调\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:219
msgid "\"myreconciler\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:220
msgid "// Ignore requests for other namespaces, if specified\n"
msgstr "// 忽略其他命名空间的请求，如果有指定的话\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:225
msgid ""
"Whenever your tests create a new namespace, it can modify the value of "
"reconciler.Namespace. The reconciler will effectively ignore the previous "
"namespace. For further information see the issue raised in the controller-"
"runtime [controller-runtime/issues/880](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"controller-runtime/issues/880) to add this support."
msgstr "每当你的测试创建一个新的命名空间时，它会修改 reconciler.Namespace 的值。reconciler 将有效地忽略之前的命名空间。有关更多信息，请参阅在 controller-runtime 中提出的问题 [controller-runtime/issues/880](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/issues/880)，以添加此支持。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:229
msgid "Cert-Manager and Prometheus options"
msgstr "Cert-Manager 和 Prometheus 选项"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:231
msgid ""
"Projects scaffolded with Kubebuilder can enable the [`metrics`](https://book."
"kubebuilder.io/reference/metrics.html) and the [`cert-manager`](https://book."
"kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.html) options. Note that when "
"we are using the ENV TEST we are looking to test the controllers and their "
"reconciliation. It is considered an integrated test because the ENV TEST API "
"will do the test against a cluster and because of this the binaries are "
"downloaded and used to configure its pre-requirements, however, its purpose "
"is mainly to `unit` test the controllers."
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 创建的项目可以启用 [`metrics`](https://book.kubebuilder.io/reference/metrics.html) 和 [`cert-manager`](https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.html) 选项。请注意，当我们使用 ENV TEST 时，我们旨在测试控制器及其协调过程。这被视为集成测试，因为 ENV TEST API 会在集群中进行测试，因此会下载并使用二进制文件来配置其前置要求。然而，其主要目的是对控制器进行 `单元` 测试。"

