"and authorization on the metrics endpoint. By using this method, you ensure "
"that the endpoint is accessible only to those with the appropriate "
"permissions."
msgstr "此配置利用 FilterProvider 对指标端点实施身份验证和授权。通过使用此方法，您可以确保该端点仅对具有适当权限的用户可访问。"

