#: src/reference/metrics.md:130
msgid ""
"**(Recommended)** Enabling certificates for Production (Disabled by default)"
msgstr "**（推荐）** 启用生产环境证书（默认情况下禁用）"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:135
msgid ""
"This option is not enabled by default because it introduces a dependency on "
"CertManager. To keep the project as lightweight and beginner-friendly as "
"possible, it is disabled by default."
msgstr "此选项默认未启用，因为它引入了对 CertManager 的依赖。为了使项目尽可能轻量且适合初学者，它默认是禁用的。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:143
msgid ""
"The default scaffold in `cmd/main.go` uses a **controller-runtime feature** "
"to automatically generate a self-signed certificate to secure the metrics "
"server. While this is convenient for development and testing, it is **not** "
"recommended for production."
msgstr "`cmd/main.go` 中的默认脚手架使用 **controller-runtime 功能** 自动生成自签名证书以保护指标服务器。虽然这在开发和测试中很方便，但**不**建议在生产环境中使用。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:148
msgid ""
"Those certificates are used to secure the transport layer (TLS). The token "
"authentication using `authn/authz`, which is enabled by default serves as "
"the application-level credential. However, for example, when you enable the "
"integration of your metrics with Prometheus, those certificates can be used "
"to secure the communication."
msgstr "这些证书用于保护传输层（TLS）。默认情况下启用的 `authn/authz` 令牌认证作为应用程序级凭据。然而，例如，当您启用与 Prometheus 的指标集成时，这些证书可以用于保护通信。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:156
msgid ""
"Projects built with Kubebuilder releases `4.4.0` and above have the logic "
"scaffolded to enable the usage of certificates managed by [CertManager]"
"(https://cert-manager.io/) for securing the metrics server. Following the "
