#: src/reference/metrics.md:259
msgid "Exporting Metrics for Prometheus"
msgstr "为 Prometheus 导出指标"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:261
msgid ""
"Follow the steps below to export the metrics using the Prometheus Operator:"
msgstr "请按照以下步骤使用 Prometheus Operator 导出指标："

#: src/reference/metrics.md:263
msgid ""
"Install Prometheus and Prometheus Operator. We recommend using [kube-"
"prometheus](https://github.com/coreos/kube-prometheus#installing) in "
"production if you don't have your own monitoring system. If you are just "
"experimenting, you can only install Prometheus and Prometheus Operator."
msgstr "安装 Prometheus 和 Prometheus Operator。如果您没有自己的监控系统，我们建议在生产环境中使用 [kube-prometheus](https://github.com/coreos/kube-prometheus#installing)。如果您只是进行试验，可以仅安装 Prometheus 和 Prometheus Operator。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:268
msgid ""
"Uncomment the line `- ../prometheus` in the `config/default/kustomization."
"yaml`. It creates the `ServiceMonitor` resource which enables exporting the "
"metrics."
msgstr "取消注释 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 中的 `- ../prometheus` 这一行。它会创建 `ServiceMonitor` 资源，从而启用指标的导出。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:276
msgid ""
"Note that, when you install your project in the cluster, it will create the "
"`ServiceMonitor` to export the metrics. To check the ServiceMonitor, run "
"`kubectl get ServiceMonitor -n <project>-system`. See an example:"
msgstr "请注意，当您在集群中安装项目时，它会创建 `ServiceMonitor` 以导出指标。要检查 ServiceMonitor，请运行 `kubectl get ServiceMonitor -n <project>-system`。以下是一个示例："

#: src/reference/metrics.md:290
msgid ""
"If you are using Prometheus Operator, be aware that, by default, its RBAC "
"rules are only enabled for the `default` and `kube-system namespaces`. See "
"its guide to know [how to configure kube-prometheus to monitor other "
"namespaces using the `.jsonnet` file](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/"
"kube-prometheus/blob/main/docs/monitoring-other-namespaces.md)."
msgstr "如果您正在使用 Prometheus Operator，请注意，其 RBAC 规则默认仅在 `default` 和 `kube-system` 命名空间中启用。请参阅其指南了解 [如何配置 kube-prometheus 以使用 `.jsonnet` 文件监控其他命名空间](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus/blob/main/docs/monitoring-other-namespaces.md)。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:294
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can give the Prometheus Operator permissions to monitor "
"other namespaces using RBAC. See the Prometheus Operator [Enable RBAC rules "
"for Prometheus pods](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-"
"operator/blob/main/Documentation/user-guides/getting-started.md#enable-rbac-"
"rules-for-prometheus-pods) documentation to know how to enable the "
"permissions on the namespace where the `ServiceMonitor` and manager exist."
msgstr "另外，您可以使用 RBAC 为 Prometheus Operator 授权以监控其他命名空间。有关如何在 `ServiceMonitor` 和管理者所在命名空间启用权限，请参阅 Prometheus Operator 的 [为 Prometheus pods 启用 RBAC 规则](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/blob/main/Documentation/user-guides/getting-started.md#enable-rbac-rules-for-prometheus-pods) 文档。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:300
msgid ""
"Also, notice that the metrics are exported by default through port `8443`. "
"In this way, you are able to check the Prometheus metrics in its dashboard. "
"To verify it, search for the metrics exported from the namespace where the "
"project is running `{namespace=\"<project>-system\"}`. See an example:"
msgstr "另外，请注意，指标默认通过端口 `8443` 导出。这样，您就可以在 Prometheus 仪表板中检查指标。要验证此操作，请搜索来自项目运行所在命名空间的指标 `{namespace=\"<project>-system\"}`。请看以下示例："

