#: src/reference/project-config.md:63
msgid "Why do we need to store the plugins and data used?"
msgstr "为什么我们需要存储插件和使用的数据？"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:65
msgid "Following some examples of motivations to track the input used:"
msgstr "以下是一些追踪使用输入的动机示例："

#: src/reference/project-config.md:66
msgid ""
"check if a plugin can or cannot be scaffolded on top of an existing plugin "
"(i.e.) plugin compatibility while chaining multiple of them together."
msgstr "检查一个插件是否可以在现有插件的基础上创建（即）插件兼容性，同时将多个插件连接在一起。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:67
msgid ""
"what operations can or cannot be done such as verify if the layout allow "
"API(s) for different groups to be scaffolded for the current configuration "
"or not."
msgstr "可以进行或不能进行的操作，例如验证当前配置是否允许为不同组搭建API的布局。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:68
msgid ""
"verify what data can or not be used in the CLI operations such as to ensure "
"that WebHooks can only be created for pre-existent API(s)"
msgstr "验证在CLI操作中可以或不能使用哪些数据，例如确保WebHooks只能为已存在的API创建。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:70
msgid ""
"Note that KubeBuilder is not only a CLI tool but can also be used as a "
"library to allow users to create their plugins/tools, provide helpers and "
"customizations on top of their existing projects - an example of which is "
"[Operator-SDK](https://sdk.operatorframework.io/). SDK leverages KubeBuilder "
"to create plugins to allow users to work with other languages and provide "
"helpers for their users to integrate their projects with, for example, the "
"[Operator Framework solutions/OLM](https://olm.operatorframework.io/). You "
"can check the [plugin's documentation](../plugins/creating-plugins.html#why-"
"use-the-kubebuilder-style) to know more about creating custom plugins."
msgstr "请注意，KubeBuilder 不仅是一个 CLI 工具，还可以用作库，让用户创建他们的插件/工具，提供帮助程序和定制，以支持他们现有的项目 - 其中一个例子是 [Operator-SDK](https://sdk.operatorframework.io/)。SDK 利用 KubeBuilder 创建插件，允许用户使用其他语言，并为用户提供帮助，以便他们将项目与例如 [Operator Framework 解决方案/OLM](https://olm.operatorframework.io/) 集成。您可以查看 [插件文档](../plugins/creating-plugins.html#why-use-the-kubebuilder-style) 以了解更多关于创建自定义插件的信息。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:72
msgid ""
"Additionally, another motivation for the PROJECT file is to help us to "
"create a feature that allows users to easily upgrade their projects by "
"providing helpers that automatically re-scaffold the project. By having all "
"the required metadata regarding the APIs, their configurations and versions "
"in the PROJECT file. For example, it can be used to automate the process of "
"re-scaffolding while migrating between plugin versions. ([More info](https://"
"github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/"
"helper_to_upgrade_projects_by_rescaffolding.md))."
msgstr "此外，PROJECT 文件的另一个目的，是帮助我们创建一个功能，使用户能够通过提供自动重新搭建项目的辅助工具，轻松升级他们的项目。PROJECT 文件中包含了有关 API、其配置和版本的所有必要元数据。例如，它可以用于自动化在插件版本之间迁移时重新搭建的过程。 ([更多信息](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/helper_to_upgrade_projects_by_rescaffolding.md))。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:74
msgid "Versioning"
msgstr "版本控制"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:76
msgid ""
"The Project config is versioned according to its layout. For further "
"information see [Versioning](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/"
"blob/master/VERSIONING.md#Versioning)."
msgstr "项目配置是根据其布局进行版本控制的。欲了解更多信息，请参见 [版本控制](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/VERSIONING.md#Versioning)。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:78
msgid "Layout Definition"
msgstr "布局定义"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:80
msgid "The `PROJECT` version `3` layout looks like:"
msgstr "`PROJECT` 版本 `3` 的布局如下："

