msgid "busybox:1.36.1"
msgstr "busybox:1.36.1"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:131
msgid "Now let's check its layout fields definition:"
msgstr "现在让我们检查一下它的布局字段定义："

#: src/reference/project-config.md:133
msgid "Field"
msgstr "领域"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:135
msgid "`layout`"
msgstr "`布局`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:135
msgid ""
"Defines the global plugins, e.g. a project `init` with `--plugins=\"go/v4,"
"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"` means that any sub-command used will always call "
"its implementation for both plugins in a chain."
msgstr "定义全局插件，例如，一个项目 `init` 使用 `--plugins=\"go/v4,deploy-image/v1-alpha\"` 意味着所使用的任何子命令将始终按顺序调用这两个插件的实现。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:136
msgid "`domain`"
msgstr "`域`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:136
msgid ""
"Store the domain of the project. This information can be provided by the "
"user when the project is generate with the `init` sub-command and the "
"`domain` flag."
msgstr "存储项目的域名。用户可以在使用 `init` 子命令和 `domain` 标志生成项目时提供此信息。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:137
msgid "`plugins`"
msgstr "`插件`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:137
msgid ""
"Defines the plugins used to do custom scaffolding, e.g. to use the optional "
"`deploy-image/v1-alpha` plugin to do scaffolding for just a specific api via "
"the command `kubebuider create api [options] --plugins=deploy-image/v1-"
"alpha`."
msgstr "定义用于自定义脚手架的插件，例如通过命令 `kubebuilder create api [options] --plugins=deploy-image/v1-alpha` 使用可选的 `deploy-image/v1-alpha` 插件仅为特定 API 创建脚手架。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:138
msgid "`projectName`"
msgstr "`项目名称`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:138
msgid ""
"The name of the project. This will be used to scaffold the manager data. By "
"default it is the name of the project directory, however, it can be provided "
"by the user in the `init` sub-command via the `--project-name` flag."
msgstr "项目名称。这将用于构建管理器数据。默认情况下，它是项目目录的名称，但用户可以通过 `init` 子命令中的 `--project-name` 标志提供该名称。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:139
msgid "`repo`"
msgstr "`代码库`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:139
msgid ""
"The project repository which is the Golang module, e.g `github.com/example/"
"myproject-operator`."
msgstr "该项目的代码库是Golang模块，例如 `github.com/example/myproject-operator`。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:140
msgid "`resources`"
msgstr "资源"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:140
msgid "An array of all resources which were scaffolded in the project."
msgstr "项目中所有搭建的资源数组。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:141
msgid "`resources.api`"
msgstr "`resources.api`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:141
msgid "The API scaffolded in the project via the sub-command `create api`."
msgstr "通过子命令 `create api` 在项目中搭建的 API。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:142
msgid "`resources.api.crdVersion`"
msgstr "`resources.api.crdVersion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:142
msgid ""
"The Kubernetes API version (`apiVersion`) used to do the scaffolding for the "
"CRD resource."
msgstr "用于为 CRD 资源搭建的 Kubernetes API 版本 (`apiVersion`)。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:143
msgid "`resources.api.namespaced`"
msgstr "`resources.api.namespaced`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:143
msgid "The API RBAC permissions which can be namespaced or cluster scoped."
msgstr "API RBAC 权限可以是命名空间级别或集群级别。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:144
msgid "`resources.controller`"
msgstr "`resources.controller`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:144
msgid "Indicates whether a controller was scaffolded for the API."
msgstr "指示是否为 API 构建了控制器。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:145
msgid "`resources.domain`"
msgstr "`resources.domain`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:145
msgid ""
"The domain of the resource which was provided by the `--domain` flag when "
"the project was initialized or via the flag `--external-api-domain` when it "
"was used to scaffold controllers for an [External Type](./"
"using_an_external_resource.md)."
msgstr "在项目初始化时通过 `--domain` 选项提供的资源域名，或者在为 [外部类型](./using_an_external_resource.md) 构建控制器时通过 `--external-api-domain` 选项提供的域名。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:146
msgid "`resources.group`"
msgstr "`resources.group`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:146
msgid ""
"The GKV group of the resource which is provided by the `--group` flag when "
"the sub-command `create api` is used."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create api` 时，通过 `--group` 标志提供的资源的 GKV 组。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:147
msgid "`resources.version`"
msgstr "`resources.version`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:147
msgid ""
"The GKV version of the resource which is provided by the `--version` flag "
"when the sub-command `create api` is used."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create api` 时，通过 `--version` 标志提供的资源的 GKV 版本。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:148
msgid "`resources.kind`"
msgstr "`资源.种类`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:148
msgid ""
"Store GKV Kind of the resource which is provided by the `--kind` flag when "
"the sub-command `create api` is used."
msgstr "存储 GKV 资源类型，该类型通过执行子命令 `create api` 时提供的 `--kind` 标志来指定。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:149
msgid "`resources.path`"
msgstr "`resources.path`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:149
msgid ""
"The import path for the API resource. It will be `<repo>/api/<kind>` unless "
"the API added to the project is an external or core-type. For the core-types "
"scenarios, the paths used are mapped [here](https://github.com/kubernetes-"
"sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/pkg/plugins/golang/options.go). Or either the "
"path informed by the flag `--external-api-path`"
msgstr "API资源的导入路径。它将是`<repo>/api/<kind>`，除非添加到项目中的API是外部API或核心类型的API。对于核心类型的场景，使用的路径在[这里](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/pkg/plugins/golang/options.go)进行了映射。或者，可以使用通过标志`--external-api-path`提供的路径。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:150
msgid "`resources.core`"
msgstr "`resources.core`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:150
msgid ""
"It is `true` when  the group used is from Kubernetes API and the API "
"resource is not defined on the project."
msgstr "当使用的组来自Kubernetes API并且项目中未定义API资源时，它为“真”。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:151
msgid "`resources.external`"
msgstr "`resources.external`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:151
msgid ""
"It is `true` when  the flag `--external-api-path` was used to generated the "
"scaffold for an [External Type](./using_an_external_resource.md)."
msgstr "当使用标志 `--external-api-path` 生成 [外部类型](./using_an_external_resource.md) 的脚手架时，它为 `true`。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:152
msgid "`resources.webhooks`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:152
msgid "Store the webhooks data when the sub-command `create webhook` is used."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create webhook` 时，请存储网络钩子数据。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:153
msgid "`resources.webhooks.spoke`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.spoke`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:153
msgid ""
"Store the API version that will act as the Spoke with the designated Hub "
"version for conversion webhooks."
msgstr "存储将作为 Spoke 的 API 版本以及用于转换 webhook 的指定 Hub 版本。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:154
msgid "`resources.webhooks.webhookVersion`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.webhookVersion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:154
msgid ""
"The Kubernetes API version (`apiVersion`) used to scaffold the webhook "
"resource."
