#: src/plugins/plugins.md:3
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder's architecture is fundamentally plugin-based. This design "
"enables the Kubebuilder CLI to evolve while maintaining backward "
"compatibility with older versions, allowing users to opt-in or opt-out of "
"specific features, and enabling seamless integration with external tools."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 的架构本质上是基于插件的。这种设计使得 Kubebuilder CLI 能够不断发展，同时与旧版本保持向后兼容，允许用户选择是否使用特定功能，并实现与外部工具的无缝集成。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:9
msgid ""
"By leveraging plugins, projects can extend Kubebuilder and use it as a "
"library to support new functionalities or implement custom scaffolding "
"tailored to their users' needs. This flexibility allows maintainers to build "
"on top of Kubebuilder’s foundation, adapting it to specific use cases while "
"benefiting from its powerful scaffolding engine."
msgstr "通过利用插件，项目可以扩展 Kubebuilder，并将其作为库来支持新功能或实现针对用户需求的自定义脚手架。这种灵活性使维护者能够在 Kubebuilder 的基础上进行构建，适应特定的用例，同时受益于其强大的脚手架引擎。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:15
msgid "Plugins offer several key advantages:"
msgstr "插件提供了几个关键优势："

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:17
msgid ""
"**Backward compatibility**: Ensures older layouts and project structures "
"remain functional with newer versions."
msgstr "**向后兼容性**：确保旧的布局和项目结构在新版本中仍然可用。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:18
msgid ""
"**Customization**: Allows users to opt-in or opt-out for specific features "
"(i.e. [Grafana](./available/grafana-v1-alpha.md) and [Deploy Image](./"
"available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) plugins)"
msgstr "**定制化**：允许用户选择启用或禁用特定功能（即 [Grafana](./available/grafana-v1-alpha.md) 和 [Deploy Image](./available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 插件）"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:19
msgid ""
"**Extensibility**: Facilitates integration with third-party tools and "
"projects that wish to provide their own [External Plugins](./extending/"
"external-plugins.md), which can be used alongside Kubebuilder to modify and "
"enhance project scaffolding or introduce new features."
msgstr "**可扩展性**：促进与希望提供自己 [外部插件](./extending/external-plugins.md) 的第三方工具和项目的集成，这些插件可以与 Kubebuilder 一起使用，以修改和增强项目的脚手架或引入新功能。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:21
msgid "**For example, to initialize a project with multiple global plugins:**"
msgstr "**例如，要初始化一个包含多个全局插件的项目：**"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:27
msgid "**For example, to apply custom scaffolding using specific plugins:**"
msgstr "**例如，要使用特定插件应用自定义脚手架：**"

