msgstr "[Prometheus Operator](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/blob/main/Documentation/user-guides/getting-started.md#related-resources) 中 serviceMonitor 的使用情况"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:1
msgid "Deploy Image Plugin (deploy-image/v1-alpha)"
msgstr "部署图像插件 (deploy-image/v1-alpha)"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:3
msgid ""
"The `deploy-image` plugin allows users to create [controllers](https://"
"github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) and custom resources that "
"deploy and manage container images on the cluster, following Kubernetes best "
"practices. It simplifies the complexities of deploying images while allowing "
"users to customize their projects as needed."
msgstr "`deploy-image` 插件允许用户创建 [控制器](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 和自定义资源，以在集群上部署和管理容器镜像，遵循 Kubernetes 的最佳实践。它简化了镜像部署的复杂性，同时允许用户根据需要自定义他们的项目。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:5
msgid "By using this plugin, you will get:"
msgstr "通过使用此插件，您将获得："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:7
msgid ""
"A controller implementation to deploy and manage an Operand (image) on the "
"cluster."
msgstr "一个控制器实现，用于在集群上部署和管理操作数（镜像）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:8
msgid ""
"Tests to verify the reconciliation logic, using [ENVTEST](./../../reference/"
"envtest.md)."
msgstr "测试以验证对账逻辑，使用 [ENVTEST](./../../reference/envtest.md)。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:9
msgid "Custom resource samples updated with the necessary specifications."
msgstr "自定义资源样本已更新至所需规格。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:10
msgid ""
"Environment variable support for managing the Operand (image) within the "
"manager."
msgstr "环境变量支持用于管理管理器中的操作数（镜像）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:15
msgid ""
"See the `project-v4-with-plugins` directory under the [testdata]"
"(./.././../../../../testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) directory in the "
"Kubebuilder project to check an example of scaffolding created using this "
"plugin."
msgstr "请查看 Kubebuilder 项目中的 [testdata](./.././../../../../testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) 目录下的 `project-v4-with-plugins` 目录，以查看使用此插件创建的脚手架示例。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:19
msgid ""
"The `Memcached` API and its controller was scaffolded using the command:"
msgstr "`Memcached` API 及其控制器是通过以下命令构建的："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:22
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder create api \\\n"
"  --group example.com \\\n"
"  --version v1alpha1 \\\n"
"  --kind Memcached \\\n"
"  --image=memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19 \\\n"
"  --image-container-command=\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,-o,modern,-v\" \\\n"
"  --image-container-port=\"11211\" \\\n"
"  --run-as-user=\"1001\" \\\n"
"  --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shell
kubebuilder create api \
  --group example.com \
  --version v1alpha1 \
  --kind Memcached \
  --image=memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19 \
  --image-container-command="memcached,--memory-limit=64,-o,modern,-v" \
  --image-container-port="11211" \
  --run-as-user="1001" \
  --plugins="deploy-image/v1-alpha"
```"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:34
msgid "The `Busybox` API was created with:"
msgstr "`Busybox` API 是通过以下方式创建的："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:36
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder create api \\\n"
"  --group example.com \\\n"
"  --version v1alpha1 \\\n"
"  --kind Busybox \\\n"
"  --image=busybox:1.36.1 \\\n"
"  --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shell
kubebuilder create api \\
  --group example.com \\
  --version v1alpha1 \\
  --kind Busybox \\
  --image=busybox:1.36.1 \\
  --plugins="deploy-image/v1-alpha"
```"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:47
msgid "When to use it?"
msgstr "什么时候使用它？"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:49
msgid ""
"This plugin is ideal for users who are just getting started with Kubernetes "
"operators."
msgstr "这个插件非常适合刚开始使用 Kubernetes operator 的用户。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:50
msgid ""
"It helps users deploy and manage an image (Operand) using the [Operator "
"pattern](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)."
msgstr "它帮助用户使用[Operator模式](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)部署和管理镜像（操作数）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:51
msgid ""
"If you're looking for a quick and efficient way to set up a custom "
"controller and manage a container image, this plugin is a great choice."
msgstr "如果您正在寻找一种快速有效的方法来设置自定义控制器并管理容器镜像，这个插件是一个很好的选择。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:53
msgid "How to use it?"
msgstr "如何使用它？"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:55
msgid ""
"**Initialize your project**: After creating a new project with `kubebuilder "
"init`, you can use this plugin to create APIs. Ensure that you've completed "
"the [quick start](./../../quick-start.md) guide before proceeding."
msgstr "**初始化您的项目**：在使用 `kubebuilder init` 创建新项目后，您可以使用此插件来创建 API。在继续之前，请确保您已完成 [快速入门](./../../quick-start.md) 指南。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:60
msgid ""
"**Create APIs**: With this plugin, you can [create APIs](../../cronjob-"
"tutorial/new-api.md) to specify the image (Operand) you want to deploy on "
"the cluster. You can also optionally specify the command, port, and security "
"context using various flags:"
msgstr "**创建 API**：使用此插件，您可以[创建 API](../../cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md)，以指定您想要在集群上部署的图像（操作数）。您还可以使用各种标志可选地指定命令、端口和安全上下文："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:63
msgid "Example command:"
msgstr "示例命令："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:65
msgid "\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,modern,-v\""
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:65
#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:415
msgid "\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\""
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:71
msgid ""
"When running the project locally with `make run`, the Operand image provided "
"will be stored as an environment variable in the `config/manager/manager."
"yaml` file."
msgstr "在本地运行项目时使用 `make run`，提供的 Operand 镜像将作为环境变量存储在 `config/manager/manager.yaml` 文件中。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:75
msgid ""
"Ensure you export the environment variable before running the project "
"locally, such as:"
msgstr "确保在本地运行项目之前导出环境变量，例如："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:77
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"export MEMCACHED_IMAGE=\"memcached:1.4.36-alpine\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shell
export MEMCACHED_IMAGE="memcached:1.4.36-alpine"
```"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:85
msgid "The `deploy-image` plugin includes the following subcommand:"
msgstr "`deploy-image` 插件包含以下子命令："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:87
msgid ""
"`create api`: Use this command to scaffold the API and controller code to "
"manage the container image."
msgstr "`create api`：使用此命令来搭建管理容器镜像的 API 和控制器代码。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:91
msgid ""
"When using the `create api` command with this plugin, the following files "
"are affected, in addition to the existing Kubebuilder scaffolding:"
msgstr "在使用带有此插件的 `create api` 命令时，除了现有的 Kubebuilder 骨架外，以下文件会受到影响："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:94
msgid "`controllers/*_controller_test.go`: Scaffolds tests for the controller."
msgstr "`controllers/*_controller_test.go`：为控制器生成测试模板。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:95
msgid "`controllers/*_suite_test.go`: Scaffolds or updates the test suite."
msgstr "`controllers/*_suite_test.go`: 搭建或更新测试套件。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:96
msgid "`api/<version>/*_types.go`: Scaffolds the API specs."
msgstr "`api/<版本>/*_types.go`：搭建 API 规范。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:97
msgid ""
"`config/samples/*_.yaml`: Scaffolds default values for the custom resource."
msgstr "`config/samples/*_.yaml`: 为自定义资源提供默认值的框架。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:98
msgid "`main.go`: Updates the file to add the controller setup."
msgstr "`main.go`: 更新文件以添加控制器设置。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:99
msgid ""
"`config/manager/manager.yaml`: Updates to include environment variables for "
"storing the image."
msgstr "`config/manager/manager.yaml`：更新以包含用于存储图像的环境变量。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:103
msgid ""
"Check out this [video](https://youtu.be/UwPuRjjnMjY) to see how it works."
msgstr "查看这个 [视频](https://youtu.be/UwPuRjjnMjY) 来了解它是如何工作的。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:1
msgid "Helm Plugin (`helm/v1-alpha`)"
msgstr "Helm 插件（`helm/v1-alpha`）"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:3
msgid ""
"The Helm plugin is an optional plugin that can be used to scaffold a Helm "
"chart, allowing you to distribute the project using Helm."
msgstr "Helm 插件是一个可选插件，可以用来搭建 Helm 图表，使您能够使用 Helm 分发项目。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:5
msgid ""
"By default, users can generate a bundle with all the manifests by running "
"the following command:"
msgstr "默认情况下，用户可以通过运行以下命令生成一个包含所有清单的包："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:11
msgid ""
"This allows the project consumer to install the solution by applying the "
"bundle with:"
msgstr "这允许项目消费者通过应用以下包来安装解决方案："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:17
msgid ""
"However, in many scenarios, you might prefer to provide a Helm chart to "
"package your solution. If so, you can use this plugin to generate the Helm "
"chart under the `dist` directory."
msgstr "然而，在许多场景中，您可能更倾向于提供一个 Helm 图表来封装您的解决方案。如果是这样，您可以使用此插件在 `dist` 目录下生成 Helm 图表。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:23
msgid ""
"You can check the plugin usage by looking at `project-v4-with-plugins` "
"samples under the [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/"
"tree/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) directory on the root "
"directory of the Kubebuilder project."
msgstr "您可以通过查看 Kubebuilder 项目根目录下的 [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) 目录中的 `project-v4-with-plugins` 示例来检查插件的使用情况。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:28
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "何时使用它"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:30
msgid ""
"If you want to provide a Helm chart for users to install and manage your "
"project."
msgstr "如果你想为用户提供一个 Helm 图表，以便他们安装和管理你的项目。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:31
msgid ""
"If you need to update the Helm chart generated under `dist/chart/` with the "
"latest project changes:"
msgstr "如果您需要使用最新的项目更改来更新位于 `dist/chart/` 目录下生成的 Helm 图表："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:32
msgid ""
"After generating new manifests, use the `edit` option to sync the Helm chart."
msgstr "生成新清单后，使用 `edit` 选项来同步 Helm 图表。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:33
msgid ""
"**IMPORTANT:** If you have created a webhook or an API using the "
"[DeployImage](./deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) plugin, you must run the "
"`edit` command with the `--force` flag to regenerate the Helm chart values "
"based on the latest manifests (_after running `make manifests`_) to ensure "
"that the HelmChart values are updated accordingly. In this case, if you have "
"customized the files under `dist/chart/values.yaml`, and the `templates/"
"manager/manager.yaml`, you will need to manually reapply your customizations "
"on top of the latest changes after regenerating the Helm chart."
msgstr "**重要：** 如果您使用 [DeployImage](./deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 插件创建了一个 webhook 或 API，您必须使用 `--force` 标志运行 `edit` 命令，以便根据最新的清单（在运行 `make manifests` 之后）重新生成 Helm chart 的值，以确保 HelmChart 的值得到相应更新。在这种情况下，如果您自定义了 `dist/chart/values.yaml` 和 `templates/manager/manager.yaml` 下的文件，您需要在重新生成 Helm chart 之后，手动在最新更改的基础上重新应用您的自定义内容。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:44
msgid ""
"The Helm plugin is attached to the `init` subcommand and the `edit` "
"subcommand:"
msgstr "Helm 插件与 `init` 子命令和 `edit` 子命令关联。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:47
msgid "# Initialize a new project with helm chart\n"
msgstr "# 使用 helm chart 初始化一个新项目"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:50
msgid ""
"# Enable or Update the helm chart via the helm plugin to an existing "
"project\n"
"# Before run the edit command, run `make manifests` to generate the manifest "
"under `config/`\n"
msgstr "# 通过 Helm 插件启用或更新现有项目的 Helm chart\n# 在运行编辑命令之前，请运行 `make manifests` 以在 `config/` 目录下生成清单。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:59
msgid ""
"After making changes to your project, ensure that you run `make manifests` "
"and then use the command `kubebuilder edit --plugins=helm/v1-alpha` to "
"update the Helm Chart."
msgstr "在对项目进行更改后，请确保运行 `make manifests`，然后使用命令 `kubebuilder edit --plugins=helm/v1-alpha` 来更新 Helm Chart。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:62
msgid ""
"Note that the following files will **not** be updated unless you use the `--"
"force` flag:"
msgstr "请注意，以下文件将**不会**被更新，除非您使用`--force`标志："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:72
msgid ""
"The files `chart/Chart.yaml`, `chart/templates/_helpers.tpl`, and `chart/."
"helmignore` are never updated after their initial creation unless you remove "
"them."
msgstr "文件 `chart/Chart.yaml`、`chart/templates/_helpers.tpl` 和 `chart/.helmignore` 在初次创建后不会被更新，除非你删除它们。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:79
msgid "The Helm plugin implements the following subcommands:"
msgstr "该 Helm 插件实现了以下子命令："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:89
msgid "`dist/chart/*`"
msgstr "`dist/chart/*`"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:1
msgid "Kustomize v2"
msgstr "Kustomize v2"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:5
msgid ""
"The Kustomize plugin allows you to scaffold all kustomize manifests used "
"with the language base plugin `base.go.kubebuilder.io/v4`. This plugin is "
"used to generate the manifest under the `config/` directory for projects "
"built within the `go/v4` plugin (default scaffold)."
msgstr "Kustomize 插件允许您为使用语言基础插件 `base.go.kubebuilder.io/v4` 的所有 kustomize 清单搭建框架。此插件用于在 `go/v4` 插件（默认脚手架）构建的项目中生成 `config/` 目录下的清单。"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:10
msgid ""
"Projects like [Operator-sdk](https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-"
"sdk) use the Kubebuilder project as a library and provide options for "
"working with other languages such as Ansible and Helm. The Kustomize plugin "
"helps them maintain consistent configuration across languages. It also "
"simplifies the creation of plugins that perform changes on top of the "
"default scaffold, removing the need for manual updates across multiple "
"language plugins. This approach allows the creation of \"helper\" plugins "
"that work with different projects and languages."
msgstr "像 [Operator-sdk](https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk) 这样的项目使用 Kubebuilder 项目作为库，并提供了与其他语言（如 Ansible 和 Helm）协作的选项。Kustomize 插件帮助它们在不同语言之间保持一致的配置。它还简化了在默认脚手架基础上执行更改的插件的创建，消除了在多个语言插件之间进行手动更新的需要。这种方法允许创建与不同项目和语言配合使用的“辅助”插件。"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:22
msgid ""
"You can check the kustomize content by looking at the `config/` directory "
"provided in the sample `project-v4-*` under the [testdata](./../../../../../"
"testdata/) directory of the Kubebuilder project."
msgstr "您可以通过查看 Kubebuilder 项目的 [testdata](./../../../../../testdata/) 目录下的示例 `project-v4-*` 中提供的 `config/` 目录来检查 kustomize 内容。"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:27
msgid "How to use it"
msgstr "如何使用它"

#: src/plugins/available/kustomize-v2.md:29
msgid ""
"If you want your language plugin to use kustomize, use the [Bundle Plugin]"
"(./../../../../../pkg/plugin/bundle.go) to specify that your language plugin "
"is composed of your language-specific plugin and kustomize for its "
"configuration, as shown:"
msgstr "如果您希望您的语言插件使用 kustomize，请使用 [Bundle Plugin](./../../../../../pkg/plugin/bundle.go) 来指定您的语言插件由特定于语言的插件和 kustomize 组成，以用于其配置，如下所示："

