#: src/plugins/extending.md:1
msgid "Extending Kubebuilder"
msgstr "扩展 Kubebuilder"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:3
#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:3
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder provides an extensible architecture to scaffold projects using "
"plugins. These plugins allow you to customize the CLI behavior or integrate "
"new features."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了一种可扩展的架构，用于使用插件搭建项目。这些插件允许您自定义 CLI 行为或集成新功能。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:9
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder’s CLI can be extended through custom plugins, allowing you to:"
msgstr "Kubebuilder 的命令行界面（CLI）可以通过自定义插件进行扩展，使您能够："

#: src/plugins/extending.md:11
msgid "Build new scaffolds."
msgstr "建立新的脚手架。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:12
msgid "Enhance existing ones."
msgstr "增强现有的。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:13
msgid "Add new commands and functionality to Kubebuilder’s scaffolding."
msgstr "为 Kubebuilder 的脚手架添加新命令和功能。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:15
msgid ""
"This flexibility enables you to create custom project setups tailored to "
"specific needs."
msgstr "这种灵活性使您能够创建根据特定需求量身定制的项目设置。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:21
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder and SDK are both broadly adopted projects which leverage the "
"[controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) "
"project. They both allow users to build solutions using the [Operator "
"Pattern](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/) "
"and follow common standards."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 和 SDK 都是广泛采用的项目，它们利用了 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 项目。它们都允许用户使用 [操作员模式](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/) 构建解决方案，并遵循共同标准。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:23
msgid ""
"Adopting these standards can bring significant benefits, such as joining "
"forces on maintaining the common standards as the features provided by "
"Kubebuilder and take advantage of the contributions made by the community. "
"This allows you to focus on the specific needs and requirements for your "
"plugin and use-case."
msgstr "采纳这些标准可以带来显著的 benefits，例如在维护共同标准方面联合力量，利用 Kubebuilder 提供的功能，以及社区所做的贡献。这使您能够专注于您的插件和用例的特定需求和要求。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:25
msgid ""
"And then, you will also be able to use custom plugins and options currently "
"or in the future which might to be provided by these projects as any other "
"which decides to persuade the same standards."
msgstr "然后，您还将能够使用当前或将来这些项目可能提供的自定义插件和选项，以及其他决定遵循相同标准的项目。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:29
msgid "Options to Extend"
msgstr "扩展选项"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:31
msgid "Extending Kubebuilder can be achieved in two main ways:"
msgstr "扩展 Kubebuilder 可以通过两种主要方式实现："

#: src/plugins/extending.md:33
msgid ""
"**Extending CLI features and Plugins**: You can import and build upon "
"existing Kubebuilder plugins to [extend its features and plugins](./"
"extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md). This is useful when you "
"need to add specific features to a tool that already benefits from "
"Kubebuilder's scaffolding system. For example, [Operator SDK](https://github."
"com/operator-framework/operator-sdk) leverages the [kustomize plugin](./"
"available/kustomize-v2.md) to provide language support for tools like "
"Ansible or Helm. So that the project can be focused to keep maintained only "
"what is specific language based."
msgstr "**扩展 CLI 功能和插件**: 您可以导入并在现有的 Kubebuilder 插件上进行构建，以 [扩展其功能和插件](./extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md)。当您需要为已从 Kubebuilder 的脚手架系统受益的工具添加特定功能时，这非常有用。例如，[Operator SDK](https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk) 利用 [kustomize 插件](./available/kustomize-v2.md) 来为 Ansible 或 Helm 等工具提供语言支持。这样，项目可以专注于维护仅与特定语言相关的内容。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:41
msgid ""
"**Creating External Plugins**: You can build standalone, independent plugins "
"as binaries. These plugins can be written in any language and should follow "
"an execution pattern that Kubebuilder recognizes. For more information, see "
"[Creating external plugins](./extending/external-plugins.md)."
msgstr "**创建外部插件**：您可以构建独立的插件作为二进制文件。这些插件可以用任何语言编写，并应遵循 Kubebuilder 识别的执行模式。有关更多信息，请参见 [创建外部插件](./extending/external-plugins.md)。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:46
msgid ""
"For further details on how to extend Kubebuilder, explore the following "
"sections:"
msgstr "有关如何扩展 Kubebuilder 的更多详情，请参考以下章节："

#: src/plugins/extending.md:48
msgid ""
"[CLI and Plugins](./extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md) to "
"learn how to extend CLI features and plugins."
msgstr "[命令行界面和插件](./extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md) 学习如何扩展命令行界面的功能和插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:49
msgid ""
"[External Plugins](./extending/external-plugins.md) for creating standalone "
"plugins."
msgstr "[外部插件](./extending/external-plugins.md) 用于创建独立插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending.md:50
msgid ""
"[E2E Tests](./extending/testing-plugins.md) to ensure your plugin functions "
"as expected."
msgstr "[E2E 测试](./extending/testing-plugins.md) 以确保您的插件按预期功能运行。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:1
msgid "Extending CLI Features and Plugins"
msgstr "扩展命令行界面功能和插件"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:7
msgid ""
"In this guide, we’ll explore how to extend CLI features, create custom "
"plugins, and bundle multiple plugins."
msgstr "在本指南中，我们将探讨如何扩展 CLI 功能、创建自定义插件以及打包多个插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:10
msgid "Creating Custom Plugins"
msgstr "创建自定义插件"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:12
msgid ""
"To create a custom plugin, you need to implement the [Kubebuilder Plugin "
"interface](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin)."
msgstr "要创建自定义插件，您需要实现 [Kubebuilder 插件接口](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin)。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:15
msgid ""
"This interface allows your plugin to hook into Kubebuilder’s commands "
"(`init`, `create api`, `create webhook`, etc.) and add custom logic."
msgstr "此接口允许您的插件挂钩到 Kubebuilder 的命令（`init`、`create api`、`create webhook` 等），并添加自定义逻辑。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:19
msgid "Example of a Custom Plugin"
msgstr "自定义插件示例"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:21
msgid ""
"You can create a plugin that generates both language-specific scaffolds and "
"the necessary configuration files, using the [Bundle Plugin](#bundle-"
"plugin). This example shows how to combine the Golang plugin with a "
"Kustomize plugin:"
msgstr "您可以创建一个插件，它生成特定语言的框架和所需的配置文件，使用 [捆绑插件](#bundle-plugin)。此示例演示如何将 Go 语言插件与 Kustomize 插件结合使用："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:33
msgid "\"mylanguage.kubebuilder.io\""
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:39
msgid ""
"This composition allows you to scaffold a common configuration base (via "
"Kustomize) and the language-specific files (via `mylanguagev1`)."
msgstr "这个结构使您能够通过 Kustomize 建立一个通用的配置基础，并通过 `mylanguagev1` 处理特定于语言的文件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:43
msgid ""
"You can also use your plugin to scaffold specific resources like CRDs and "
"controllers, using the `create api` and `create webhook` subcommands."
msgstr "您还可以使用您的插件来构建特定的资源，例如 CRD 和控制器，使用 `create api` 和 `create webhook` 子命令。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:47
msgid "Plugin Subcommands"
msgstr "插件子命令"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:49
msgid ""
"Plugins are responsible for implementing the code that will be executed when "
"the sub-commands are called. You can create a new plugin by implementing the "
"[Plugin interface](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin)."
msgstr "插件负责实现当子命令被调用时将执行的代码。您可以通过实现 [插件接口](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin) 来创建一个新的插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:52
msgid ""
"On top of being a `Base`, a plugin should also implement the "
"[`SubcommandMetadata`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/"
"plugin#SubcommandMetadata) interface so it can be run with a CLI. "
"Optionally, a custom help text for the target  command can be set; this "
"method can be a no-op, which will preserve the default help text set by the "
"[cobra](https://github.com/spf13/cobra) command constructors."
msgstr "除了作为 `Base` 之外，插件还应实现 [`SubcommandMetadata`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin#SubcommandMetadata) 接口，以便可以通过 CLI 运行。可选地，可以为目标命令设置自定义帮助文本；此方法可以是无操作的，这将保留由 [cobra](https://github.com/spf13/cobra) 命令构造函数设置的默认帮助文本。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:58
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder CLI plugins wrap scaffolding and CLI features in conveniently "
"packaged Go types that are executed by the `kubebuilder` binary, or any "
"binary which imports them. More specifically, a plugin configures the "
"execution of one of the following CLI commands:"
msgstr "Kubebuilder CLI 插件将脚手架和 CLI 功能包装在方便的 Go 类型中，这些类型由 `kubebuilder` 二进制文件或任何导入它们的二进制文件执行。更具体地说，一个插件配置以下 CLI 命令之一的执行："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:62
msgid "`init`: Initializes the project structure."
msgstr "`init`：初始化项目结构。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:63
msgid "`create api`: Scaffolds a new API and controller."
msgstr "`create api`：生成一个新的 API 和控制器。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:64
msgid "`create webhook`: Scaffolds a new webhook."
msgstr "`创建 webhook`: 建立一个新的 webhook。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:65
msgid "`edit`: edit the project structure."
msgstr "`编辑`: 编辑项目结构。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:67
msgid "Here’s an example of using the `init` subcommand with a custom plugin:"
msgstr "以下是使用 `init` 子命令与自定义插件的示例："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:73
msgid "This would initialize a project using the `mylanguage` plugin."
msgstr "这将使用 `mylanguage` 插件初始化一个项目。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:75
msgid "Plugin Keys"
msgstr "插件密钥"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:77
msgid ""
"Plugins are identified by a key of the form `<name>/<version>`. There are "
"two ways to specify a plugin to run:"
msgstr "插件通过 `<name>/<version>` 形式的键来识别。指定要运行的插件的方式有两种："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:80
msgid ""
"Setting `kubebuilder init --plugins=<plugin key>`, which will initialize a "
"project configured for plugin with key `<plugin key>`."
msgstr "设置 `kubebuilder init --plugins=<plugin key>`，将初始化一个为键为 `<plugin key>` 的插件配置的项目。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:83
msgid ""
"A `layout: <plugin key>` in the scaffolded [PROJECT configuration file]"
"(./../../reference/project-config.md). Commands (except for `init`, which "
"scaffolds this file) will look at this value before running to choose which "
"plugin to run."
msgstr "在生成的 [项目配置文件](./../../reference/project-config.md) 中的 `layout: <插件键>`。在运行命令时（除了初始化命令，它会生成此文件），命令会查看该值以选择要运行的插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:85
msgid ""
"By default, `<plugin key>` will be `go.kubebuilder.io/vX`, where `X` is some "
"integer."
msgstr "默认情况下，`<plugin key>` 将为 `go.kubebuilder.io/vX`，其中 `X` 是某个整数。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:87
msgid ""
"For a full implementation example, check out Kubebuilder's native [`go."
"kubebuilder.io`](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/book-v4/"
"pkg/plugins/golang/v4) plugin."
msgstr "要查看完整的实现示例，请查看 Kubebuilder 的原生 [`go.kubebuilder.io`](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/book-v4/pkg/plugins/golang/v4) 插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:89
msgid "Plugin naming"
msgstr "插件命名"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:91
msgid ""
"Plugin names must be DNS1123 labels and should be fully qualified, i.e. they "
"have a suffix like `.example.com`. For example, the base Go scaffold used "
"with `kubebuilder` commands has name `go.kubebuilder.io`. Qualified names "
"prevent conflicts between plugin names; both `go.kubebuilder.io` and `go."
"example.com` can both scaffold Go code and can be specified by a user."
msgstr "插件名称必须是 DNS1123 标签，并且应为完全合格的名称，即它们有一个后缀，如 `.example.com`。例如，使用 `kubebuilder` 命令的基础 Go 脚手架名称为 `go.kubebuilder.io`。合格的名称可以避免插件名称之间的冲突；`go.kubebuilder.io` 和 `go.example.com` 都可以生成 Go 代码，并且可以由用户指定。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:96
msgid "Plugin versioning"
msgstr "插件版本管理"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:98
msgid ""
"A plugin's `Version()` method returns a [`plugin.Version`](https://pkg.go."
"dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin#Version) object containing an "
"integer value and optionally a stage string of either \"alpha\" or \"beta\". "
"The integer denotes the current version of a plugin. Two different integer "
"values between versions of plugins indicate that the two plugins are "
"incompatible. The stage string denotes plugin stability:"
msgstr "插件的 `Version()` 方法返回一个 [`plugin.Version`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin#Version) 对象，包含一个整数值和可选的阶段字符串，它可以是“alpha”或“beta”。该整数表示插件的当前版本。两个不同的整数值表示插件版本之间的不兼容性。阶段字符串表示插件的稳定性："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:103
msgid ""
"`alpha`: should be used for plugins that are frequently changed and may "
"break between uses."
msgstr "`alpha`：应该用于那些经常更改并可能在使用之间出现故障的插件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:104
msgid ""
"`beta`: should be used for plugins that are only changed in minor ways, ex. "
"bug fixes."
msgstr "`beta`：应适用于仅在小幅度上进行更改的插件，例如错误修复。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:106
msgid "Boilerplates"
msgstr "标准文本"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:108
msgid ""
"The Kubebuilder internal plugins use boilerplates to generate the files of "
"code. Kubebuilder uses templating to scaffold files for plugins. For "
"instance, when creating a new project, the `go/v4` plugin scaffolds the `go."
"mod` file using a template defined in its implementation."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 内部插件使用模板来生成代码文件。Kubebuilder 通过模板化来搭建插件的文件。例如，在创建新项目时，`go/v4` 插件会使用其实现中定义的模板来生成 `go.mod` 文件。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:114
msgid ""
"You can extend this functionality in your custom plugin by defining your own "
"templates and using [Kubebuilder’s machinery library](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/pkg/machinery) to generate files. "
"This library allows you to:"
msgstr "您可以通过定义自己的模板并使用 [Kubebuilder 的机械库](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/pkg/machinery) 来生成文件，从而扩展您自定义插件的功能。该库允许您："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:119
msgid "Define file I/O behaviors."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:120
msgid ""
"Add [markers](./../../reference/markers/scaffold.md) to the scaffolded files."
msgstr "将[标记](./../../reference/markers/scaffold.md)添加到搭建的文件中。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:121
msgid "Specify templates for your scaffolds."
msgstr "为您的脚手架指定模板。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:123
msgid "Example: Boilerplate"
msgstr "示例：样板文本"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:125
msgid ""
"For instance, the go/v4 scaffolds the `go.mod` file by defining an object "
"that [implements the machinery interface](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/"
"kubebuilder/tree/master/pkg/machinery). The raw template is set to the "
"`TemplateBody` field on the `Template.SetTemplateDefaults` method:"
msgstr "例如，go/v4 通过定义一个实现了 [machinery 接口](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/pkg/machinery) 的对象来搭建 `go.mod` 文件。原始模板被设置为 `Template.SetTemplateDefaults` 方法中的 `TemplateBody` 字段："

