#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:230
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder provides utility functions to help you modify the default "
"scaffolds. By using the [plugin utilities](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/"
"kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin/util), you can insert, replace, or append content "
"to files generated by Kubebuilder, giving you full control over the "
"scaffolding process."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了实用函数，帮助您修改默认的脚手架。通过使用 [插件工具](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder/v4/pkg/plugin/util)，您可以向 Kubebuilder 生成的文件插入、替换或附加内容，从而完全控制脚手架的过程。"

