#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:392
msgid ""
"The CLI is responsible for managing the [PROJECT file configuration](./../../"
"reference/project-config.md), which represents the configuration of the "
"projects scaffolded by the CLI tool."
msgstr "CLI 负责管理 [项目文件配置](./../../reference/project-config.md)，该配置表示由 CLI 工具搭建的项目的配置。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:396
msgid ""
"When extending Kubebuilder, it is recommended to ensure that your tool or "
"[External Plugin](external-plugins.md) properly uses the [PROJECT file]"
"(./../../reference/project-config.md) to track relevant information. This "
"ensures that other external tools and plugins can properly integrate with "
"the project. It also allows tools features to help users re-scaffold their "
"projects such as the [Project Upgrade Assistant](./../../reference/"
"rescaffold.md) provided by Kubebuilder, ensuring the tracked information in "
"the PROJECT file can be leveraged for various purposes."
msgstr "在扩展 Kubebuilder 时，建议确保您的工具或 [外部插件](external-plugins.md) 正确使用 [PROJECT 文件](./../../reference/project-config.md) 来跟踪相关信息。这确保了其他外部工具和插件可以与项目正确集成。它还允许工具特性帮助用户重新构建他们的项目，例如 Kubebuilder 提供的 [项目升级助手](./../../reference/rescaffold.md)，确保 PROJECT 文件中跟踪的信息可以用于多种目的。"

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:405
msgid ""
"For example, plugins can check whether they support the project setup and re-"
"execute commands based on the tracked inputs."
msgstr "例如，插件可以检查它们是否支持项目设置，并根据跟踪的输入重新执行命令。"

