"deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) plugin to scaffold an API and its "
"controller:"
msgstr "通过运行以下命令使用 [Deploy Image](./../available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 插件来搭建 API 及其控制器："

