"`PluginRequest` contains the data collected from the CLI and any previously "
"executed plugins. Kubebuilder sends this data as a JSON object to the "
"external plugin via `stdin`."
msgstr "`PluginRequest`包含从CLI收集的数据以及之前执行的插件。Kubebuilder通过`stdin`将这些数据作为JSON对象发送给外部插件。"

