#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:89
msgid "External plugins can support the following Kubebuilder subcommands:"
msgstr "外部插件可以支持以下 Kubebuilder 子命令："

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:90
msgid "`init`: Project initialization"
msgstr "`init`: 项目初始化"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:91
msgid "`create api`: Scaffold Kubernetes API definitions"
msgstr "`create api`: 创建 Kubernetes API 定义的脚手架"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:92
msgid "`create webhook`: Scaffold Kubernetes webhooks"
msgstr "`创建 webhook`: 创建 Kubernetes webhooks 的骨架"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:93
msgid "`edit`: Update project configuration"
msgstr "`编辑`: 更新项目配置"

