msgid "**Optional subcommands for enhanced user experience:**"
msgstr "**可选子命令以增强用户体验：**"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:96
msgid ""
"`metadata`: Provide plugin descriptions and examples with the `--help` flag."
msgstr "`metadata`: 提供使用 `--help` 标志的插件描述和示例。"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:97
msgid ""
"`flags`: Inform Kubebuilder of supported flags, enabling early error "
"detection."
msgstr "`flags`：通知Kubebuilder支持的标志，以便提前检测错误。"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:102
msgid ""
"The `flags` subcommand in an external plugin allows for early error "
"detection by informing Kubebuilder about the flags the plugin supports. If "
"an unsupported flag is identified, Kubebuilder can issue an error before the "
"plugin is called to execute. If a plugin does not implement the `flags` "
"subcommand, Kubebuilder will pass all flags to the plugin, making it the "
"external plugin's responsibility to handle any invalid flags."
msgstr "外部插件中的 `flags` 子命令允许通过告知 Kubebuilder 插件支持的标志来提前进行错误检测。如果识别到不支持的标志，Kubebuilder 可以在调用插件执行之前发出错误。如果插件没有实现 `flags` 子命令，Kubebuilder 将把所有标志传递给插件，因此处理任何无效标志的责任将由外部插件承担。"

