#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:5
msgid ""
"Tagged versions of the Kubebuilder project, representing changes to the "
"source code in this repository. See the [releases](https://github.com/"
"kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) page for binary releases."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 项目的标记版本，表示该仓库中源代码的更改。有关二进制版本，请参阅 [releases](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/releases) 页面。"

