msgstr "项目版本"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:6
msgid "`\"1\"`, `\"2\"`, `\"3\"`"
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:6
msgid ""
"Project version defines the scheme of a `PROJECT` configuration file. This "
"version is defined in a `PROJECT` file's `version`."
msgstr "项目版本定义了 `PROJECT` 配置文件的模式。此版本在 `PROJECT` 文件的 `version` 中定义。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:7
msgid "Plugin version"
msgstr "插件版本"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:7
msgid "`v2`, `v3`, `v4`"
msgstr "您训练的数据截至2023年10月。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:7
msgid ""
"Represents the version of an individual plugin, as well as the corresponding "
"scaffolding that it generates. This version is defined in a plugin key, ex. "
"`go.kubebuilder.io/v2`. See the [design doc](./extending#plugin-versioning) "
"for more details."
msgstr "表示单个插件的版本，以及它生成的相应框架。该版本在插件键中定义，例如 `go.kubebuilder.io/v2`。有关更多详细信息，请参见 [设计文档](./extending#plugin-versioning)。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:9
msgid "Incrementing versions"
msgstr "版本递增"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:11
msgid ""
"For more information on how Kubebuilder release versions work, see the "
"[semver](https://semver.org/) documentation."
msgstr "有关 Kubebuilder 版本发布如何工作的更多信息，请参阅 [semver](https://semver.org/) 文档。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:13
msgid ""
"Project versions should only be increased if a breaking change is introduced "
"in the PROJECT file scheme itself. Changes to the Go scaffolding or the "
"Kubebuilder CLI _do not_ affect project version."
msgstr "只有在项目文件方案本身引入破坏性更改时，项目版本才应该增加。对 Go 脚手架或 Kubebuilder CLI 的更改不影响项目版本。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:15
msgid ""
"Similarly, the introduction of a new plugin version might only lead to a new "
"minor version release of Kubebuilder, since no breaking change is being made "
"to the CLI itself. It'd only be a breaking change to Kubebuilder if we "
"remove support for an older plugin version. See the plugins design doc "
"[versioning section](./extending#plugin-versioning) for more details on "
"plugin versioning."
msgstr "同样，新的插件版本的引入可能只会导致 Kubebuilder 发布一个新的次要版本，因为 CLI 本身没有进行破坏性更改。只有在我们移除对旧版本插件的支持时，这才会对 Kubebuilder 造成破坏性更改。有关插件版本管理的更多详细信息，请参阅插件设计文档中的[版本控制部分](./extending#plugin-versioning)。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:18
msgid "Introducing changes to plugins"
msgstr "介绍插件的更改"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:20
msgid ""
"Changes made to plugins only require a plugin version increase if and only "
"if a change is made to a plugin that breaks projects scaffolded with the "
"previous plugin version. Once a plugin version `vX` is stabilized (it "
"doesn't have an \"alpha\" or \"beta\" suffix), a new plugin package should "
"be created containing a new plugin with version `v(X+1)-alpha`. Typically "
"this is done by (semantically) `cp -r pkg/plugins/golang/vX pkg/plugins/"
"golang/v(X+1)` then updating version numbers and paths. All further breaking "
"changes to the plugin should be made in this package; the `vX` plugin would "
"then be frozen to breaking changes."
msgstr "对插件所做的更改仅在发生导致与之前插件版本搭建的项目不兼容的更改时，才需要提高插件版本。一旦插件版本 `vX` 稳定（不带有 “alpha” 或 “beta” 后缀），应该创建一个新的插件包，其中包含版本 `v(X+1)-alpha` 的新插件。通常通过（语义上）执行 `cp -r pkg/plugins/golang/vX pkg/plugins/golang/v(X+1)`，然后更新版本号和路径来完成这一操作。所有后续对插件的破坏性更改都应在此包中进行；`vX` 插件将被冻结，不能再进行破坏性更改。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:27
msgid ""
"You must also add a migration guide to the [migrations](../migrations.md) "
"section of the Kubebuilder book in your PR. It should detail the steps "
"required for users to upgrade their projects from `vX` to `v(X+1)-alpha`."
msgstr "您还必须在您的 PR 中将迁移指南添加到 Kubebuilder 书籍的 [migrations](../migrations.md) 部分。该指南应详细说明用户将项目从 `vX` 升级到 `v(X+1)-alpha` 所需的步骤。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:35
msgid ""
"Kubebuilder scaffolds projects with plugin `go.kubebuilder.io/v4` by default."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 默认使用插件 `go.kubebuilder.io/v4` 来搭建项目。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:37
msgid ""
"You create a feature that adds a new marker to the file `main.go` scaffolded "
"by `init` that `create api` will use to update that file. The changes "
"introduced in your feature would cause errors if used with projects built "
"with plugins `go.kubebuilder.io/v4` without users manually updating their "
"projects."
msgstr "你创建了一个功能，该功能将在 `init` 所生成的文件 `main.go` 中添加一个新标记，`create api` 将使用这个标记来更新该文件。你所引入的变化将导致与使用插件 `go.kubebuilder.io/v4` 构建的项目一起使用时出现错误，除非用户手动更新他们的项目。"

#: src/plugins/plugins-versioning.md:41
msgid ""
"Thus, your changes introduce a breaking change to plugin `go.kubebuilder."
"io`, and can only be merged into plugin version `v5-alpha`. This plugin's "
"package should exist already."
msgstr "因此，您的更改对插件 `go.kubebuilder.io` 引入了一个破坏性的变化，只能合并到插件版本 `v5-alpha` 中。该插件的包应该已经存在。"

